<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">unfoldingWord Literal Text</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Laisiukwak Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samuel Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam.</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">Samuel Laisiukwak Keraibe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Samuel laisiukwak keraibe ga Samuel penai Saul, nah David ha kekiee ge raupwala. Samuel keraide Samuel de mna kelu nah kerecaki ga heciem kereli ha pwa ndeulu. Cika pa dainzwa caihakeci, cingku, nah tutiak teigwangbi kecu raupwala.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israelme hegwangpei ge kie kedidau, Samuel, Tinggwang puisau gade Saul de Israel gwangpei keraibe keniaklu. Dede Saul Tinggwang samzai teilu tadi nah Tinggwang pecu hegwang ketei gade mlaidi. Pecai Samuel ngkim David depeu Saul bam pwa kera keniaklu. Saul penai David kakga kehebwak le laisiukwak aide kebambe teipwa bam. Anui mina aidungde samzai teikemak ha cilu liede penui keyi nah Tinggwang samzaiketei ngkiengki kecu cilu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aidauting Israel reha heleuhbe penui muiteu tutiakme gade penui kidamedung leuh nzwa hegwangpei ge kebam teidi. Samuel, caihakeci, cingku, nah tutiak, tei eh aipau tingkakde ngkieng süt kecu teigwang.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Eli cingku nah tutiak ketei (1:1-4:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Samuel Israel muiteu ketei (5:1-8:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul Israel gwangpei raitube (9:1-15:35)</para>
  <para style="io1">David nah Saul (16:1-30:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul tsit (31:1-13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Samuel de kemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Mige pe zi Elkanah lie kecu ge Ephraim deudi, Zuph cuikui ga Ramah namceu ga lungh bamla. Pa au Ephraim leuhme Jeroham napei, Elihu napei, Tohu napei, Zuph napei. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Pa penau hangna bamla; keraibe pui zi cai Hannah, nah pe kenabe pui zi cai Peninnah. Peninnah pe name lunghlu, dede Hannah pena tei ma. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Elkanah mmi ramsang kum pe namdibe gade tetmie Shiloh nam ga reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de reca nah ratak teibeu bamla. Cidau cika Eli napei kena, Hophni penai Phinehas ne RAMPAUBE cingkupei teibam. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Mmi ramsang kum Elkanah ratak keteidau, pa pe nau Peninnah, nah penai napeime nah napuime de hetei qwa ramcau peu muila. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Dede pa Hannah de qwana peu muila, kedanemene pa Hannah de kusüt kecune, RAMPAUBE pe henabam ngkuidi liede. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />RAMPAUBE pe henabam ngkui kedine, Peninnah pe kemei tei eh pe rata teisüt bamla. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Cine mmi ramsang kum Hannah pe kelak de ngngwalwe RAMPAUBE kiga nghang kecudau, Peninnah pe kemei tei bamla. Ciziemne pa hap eh magede tyei mene bamla. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Pe nahpei Elkanah pecu rang muila, “Hannah, nang daitei hap bamno? Nang daitei matyei meno? Daitei n suisia bamla no? Ih au n ziemne n na mipei hang kerei swa yiki me luini?” <verse eid="1SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Aikenzwa ting dauge, Shiloh gade penui matyei nah sak kelucai Hannah cuhdi. Cidau cingkupei Eli RAMPAUBE kerecaki kimui tet kelwet lampui taiga pe bam ga ntum bam. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hannah pelung keherei sütdi eh RAMPAUBE dage hapsüt eh kekie teigai. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Pa pe sam pet eh ranggai, “Reugwame reu RAMPAUBO, nang n kilabe keherei kebam de piegai eh acu nsunglu liecai, nah n kilabe de nsung tadi mene, n kilabe de mipeina ge peu liecai, iciucai Ih pe teilung zie pelane RAMPAUBE de peu zie, nah pe peutam madaude tai lak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:48">Luk. 1:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Pa RAMPAUBE dwa kekie tei kebam dau, Eli pe mui ncet bam. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hannah pe lung gade kekie tei bam. Pe muileu nlai bam, dede pe kwa siu ma. Ciziemne Eli pa sakmie bam lie cetdi. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Eli pe dage rangdi, “Nang dai ting tie ge sakmie bam lai no? Zau sakta dilu.” <verse eid="1SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hannah keligai, “Ma, a mpaubo, Ih au lungrei kebam pui ge. Ih zau mede zau kengkieng sak ma, dede Ih RAMPAUBE dage a lungrei paugai bamla. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />N kilabe de kemta pui ge lie cet so; Ih a lungrei nah suisiet kepui tei eh kekie teibam.” <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Cidau Eli sam keligai, “N lung nciep eh tetcuh; Israel Tinggwang de peu nang pe dade kie kegaide tei beulo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:34">Mrk. 5:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Pa rangdi, “Peu n kilabe de n dwade ngaugia ngau kelube teilo. Pecai mipuibe tetdi nah matyeilu; pa pesui kesia bamsi tadi.” <verse eid="1SA 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Pecai benai penui tingcang nuge cuhlu eh RAMPAUBE de recalu, nah pecai penui ki Ramah ga cailigwang daidi. Elkanah penau Hannah de ngngwa nauhepei zai teidi, nah RAMPAUBE pe kekie teibeu. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Cinzwa eh Hannah tetlaklu nah mipeina ge de mnalu. Pa pe zi Samuel msiaklu eh ranggai, “Ih RAMPAUBE dade pecu kie kelune.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hannah ne Samuel de teimci kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elkanah nah pe kilungme pelane RAMPAUBE dage mmi ratak nah pe sampet de tei kera tetmie dai. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Dede Hannah mie ma; pa pe nahpei dage rangdi, “Henanabe ngkieng lu herezi, Ih pecu ngngwa mie zie, iciude pa RAMPAUBE dwaga bam nah cika kelungta lungh dilu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Pe nahpei Elkanah pe dage rangdi, “Cet eh yitube tei lulo. Nang pecu nküt ngkienglu kemaktane kwalu; RAMPAUBE de peu n sam de teicang kelube teilo.” Cine mipuibe pena de nepam eh pecu nküt ngkienglu kemaktane bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Pa pecu nküt ngkienglu ge, pa pecu ngngwalwe ketumseu mmi kecum nage, taktyei ephah ge <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taktyei ephah ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram kerei</char></note>nah zaula ge si eh punglwe Shiloh ga RAMPAUBE ki ga gwanglu. Nah hena nabe hena bamreu. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Penui ketumseu gilu eh Eli dage hena nabe de ngngwa gwangbeu. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Pa rangdi, “Oh, a mpaubo! Nang ring kela zi gade ranggai la, a mpaubo, Ih aika ntai ga sap eh RAMPAUBE dage kekie ketei puide delie.” <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Ih hena aide ziemne kiegai nah RAMPAUBE Ih kie kegaide teibeu delie. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ih pecu RAMPAUBE de peu dida, pa ring kelatane pa RAMPAUBE gu teizie. Pecai pa cikade RAMPAUBE de recadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keheci laisiudung kesa ga, </char><char style="fqa">pecai penui cikade RAMPAUBE de recadi, de eh bam. </char> </note><verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hannah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Hannah kekie tei eh rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“A nlung RAMPAUBE de twabam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">A kii RAMPAUBE dage pwa cuh luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Ih a ngauraume dade hegiela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">nang kelikebeu de ga a suiyi kebamne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luk. 1:46</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 1:47">47</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Migede RAMPAUBE nzwa mci ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">Nang kenzwa migede gah;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">Anui Tinggwang kenzwa tsura keda gede gah.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Hegie eh ngang sütla tadi lu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Nnui mui gade ngang kela samdung pet ta dilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au maci Tinggwang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Pa ne heta leune mdetla.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Reugwame lakpi cum dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">dede kemneime de tei ngkieng beula.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Nggei kelame taktyei ziemne penuikatei penuide li teula dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mzeu kelame mzeu si meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Nagah pui pe na hang hena mna luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">dede hename kekiee ge kebam pui nnei dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:53">Luk. 1:53</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />RAMPAUBE ketsai nah kering teugwang beula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">Pa ketsaime deu gage ngngwa gai nah teucuh dai beula.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />RAMPAUBE midung gede peu magah nah midung gede tei mahei beula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Pa midung tei hena dila, dede pa midung gede teucuh dai beula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:52">Luk. 1:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Pa kegahme de rebui gade teucuh lula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Pa naang kelame de ralie tum gade teucu beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">penuide peu hegwang namedung de ngngwa bam kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">nah kerüt bam de gumlu kerane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Kedanemene kideube tsiangdidung au RAMPAUBE gu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">nah pa cidung reu gage kideube teilu.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Pa pe mina masang kelame de gum beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">dede kenlienme de kemui gage kai zing dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Migede pe kengking le ngkieng gailak lu.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />RAMPAUBE de renia kelabe de ngkap dizie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">pa penuide mmau eh tinggim gade tingceu gaizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">RAMPAUBE kideu pelane tutiak zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">pa pe hegwangpei de kengkieng peuzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">nah pa keniak kelube gwangpei kii pwacuh beuzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:69">Luk. 1:69</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Cidau Elkanah pe ki Ramah ga gwangdi. Henana be cingkupei Eli kang gade RAMPAUBE gwatei bamdi.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli napei kena kenlien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Cu Eli napeidung au kemta kaudung ge. Penui RAMPAUBE de cima. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Cingkumedung mina dage teikela zaide cai, mi keheibe de ratak tei kegaidau, cingkupei Eli napeidung kilabe hegeutia pe peutie-kecum tei kecu ge pwalwe gwangla. Ratak tei kera teih lang nswak kebam dau, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />kilabe hegeutia de keheta li, mede cikia li, mede lidi, mede ma li gage keci gaila. Hegeutia de keci mpet kelube cingkupei pe ziemne keu lula. Penui aide Israelme reca kera Shiloh ga gwang kecume leune dade ainzwa teila. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Cipau reude, penui pecaa ru kecu dwa, cingkupei kilabe gwang eh ratak tei kebambe pei dage rangla, “Cingkupei ziemne heteih rubeu kera peulo; kedanemene nang heteih lang kedibe pa luu laklu, dede kengeube rünne luu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Magade ratak tei kebambe pe dade, “Penui pecaa ru rai maisia, nah pecai ne nang keu keneu kiee ge keulu,” de eh rangcai, pa rangzie, “Lak, nang cide acu cu peuzie; mecai, Ih n kemei tei eh cide keu luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Eli napeidung mau RAMPAUBE dwade di zudi, penui RAMPAUBE de reca teikebeu de rütta kedine . <verse eid="1SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Dede Samuel hename ge liede langcim le teikelu hekeutupai <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hekeutupai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pai aide reca ta teigwang kecudau ncwala. (2:28; 14:3; 21:9; 22:18; 2 Sam. 6:14) </char></note>teu eh RAMPAUBE gwatei bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Pe pui pe nahpei de ngngwalwe mmi ramsang kum ratak tei kera hang kecudau, pe ziemne cwatie keceu nage teilwe mmi ramsang kum pecu keugwang beula. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli Elkanah nah penau de samlam beu eh rangla, “RAMPAUBE de peu aipau puide dade, pa RAMPAUBE de peu kedibe ding tei eh hena kekiee peusi kelube teilo.” Pecai penai penui kilung ga cailigwang dila. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />RAMPAUBE Hannah de ngha daibeu, nah pa tetlak dailu. Pa mipeina hangcum nah mipuina hangna lungh silu. Cidau, hena nabe Samuel RAMPAUBE dwa gade ngkieng cuhdi. <verse eid="1SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Cu Eli cing sütdi; pa pe napeime Israelme pelane dage tei kebam leune siulu, nah penui Tinggwang kebam paiki kimui ga hegwa teibam kela puidung de ngngwa zeu kela cibam. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daitei cidungde teila no?” Ih mileune dade nnui heta kesia tei kebam siubam dida. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Nnui tei sita dilu, a napeidung; Ih siu kebam de sam keyibe ma. Nnui RAMPAUBE minadung de peu kemau tei bam dida. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Mige kedage dage kemau teigai cai, Tinggwang pe tutiak zie; dede mige RAMPAUBE dage kemau teigai cai, caune pe lamsap beulai?” Dede penui penui pei kwa kingnei tadi, kedanemene RAMPAUBE penuide teitset di kera pe lungning kedine. <verse eid="1SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Hena nabe Samuel ngkieng cuhlu, nah RAMPAUBE nah mina suiyi teilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:52">Luk. 2:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli kelak de caiha kemmau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Cu Tinggwang minabe Eli da gwang eh pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE rangla, ‘Ih n paume <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paume: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aron nah pe kibaume.</char></note>dage, penui Egypt ga Pharaoh kangga hebaang tei keladau acu peu ngaugai meni?’ <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Ih Aaron de Israel leuh pelane kakde peu a cingku tei kerane kedetlu, a recabam ga nghang kera, marim kehengui ru kera, nah hekeutupai a dwaga teu kerane. Ih n pau kilungme de Israelmena keru ratak tei kegai leune peu da. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ciciucai, nang daitei Ih lungh kebam ga Ih teu mai kesia a ratakdung nah recadung hengim lano? Nang daitei n namedung de acu swa rütki eh a mina Israelme reca tei kebeu keyi leune teu nnui luiyi bamno? <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, rangzeu, ‘Ih n kilungme, nah n pau kilungme de peu kelungta a gwatei kera sampet gaida.’ Dede cu ‘RAMPAUBE rangzeu, ‘Ciciude Ih cide tei lakda, kedanemene Ih acu rüt kelame de rüt zie, dede acu nlai kelame de nlai zie. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Pielo, Ih n kengkieng nah n pau kilungme kengkieng dangdi kera peting ge gwangla dida, iciude n pautsame kecingme migede gah dizie. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Ih lungh kebam ni ga nang lungrei ngau zie. Israel de lung keyi peu liede, n kiga kecingme migede gah dizie. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ih a recabam gade dangdi kemak keheibe de peu pe miak siadi zie, nah pe teilung lungrei le puizie. N kelak ga mina lungh kelu leune tsai dizie. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Aide n napei kena, Hophni nah Phinehas da gwang kera n ziemne marengei ge zie: penai tingnai ge gage tsai dizie. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Ih a ziemne samsang kecu cingku ge, a kecet nah a nlung suibe teibeu kera gede teucuh luzie. Ih pe kelak tei ngkieng beuzie; nah pa Ih keniakkelu hegwangpei dwa kelungta hegwa teila zie. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />N kelak ga bang kebamme leune gwang pe dwa keumie rangkanggeu nah taktyei kie eh rangzie, “Nggia eh acu peu cingkume de kenghame teilo, ciude Ih tangku gede tyeilu kerane.”’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">RAMPAUBE Samuel de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Hena nabe Samuel Eli kang gade RAMPAUBE gwatei. RAMPAUBE dade sam cipau tingdau gwang camsüt; marengei kengau de camsüt. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Cipau tingdau, pe miak mnei reureu di eh mangau mcita kedibe Eli, pe zeu ga zeu bam. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Tinggwang mibung heu bamreu, nah Samuel RAMPAUBE kerecaki, Tinggwang Samkakbung kebam ga zip kera ga zeubam. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ge RAMPAUBE Samuel de qugai, nah pa keligai, “Ih aika bam.” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Samuel Eli da pakmie eh rangdi, “Ih aika bam, nang acu qu ni?” Eli rangdi, “Ih ncu qu ma; gwang zeudai dilu.” Cine Samuel gwang zeudi. <verse eid="1SA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />RAMPAUBE qudai, “Samuel.” Ge Samuel cuh dailwe Eli da mie eh rangdi, “Ih aika bam, nang acu qu ni?” Eli keligai, “Ih ncu qu ma, a na; zeudai cu.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Cu Samuel cide RAMPAUBE lie kecu cima, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pedwale madauge de peda marang kemakne. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />RAMPAUBE Samuel de pia pe kecumbe qugai dai. Samuel cuh dailu delwe Eli da mie eh rangdi, “Ih aika bam, nang acu qu ni?” Cidau Eli RAMPAUBE ne mipei nabe de qu kebam cilu. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Cidau Eli Samuel dage rangdi, “Gwang zeu daicu; pa ncu qudai cai, nang ranglu maisia, ‘Ranggailo, RAMPAUBO, n kilabe kingnei bamlie.’” Cine Samuel gwang pe zeu ga zeu daidi.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />RAMPAUBE gwang saplu; pa pedwa nzwa qugai, “Samuel, Samuel.” Cidau Samuel rangdi, “Ranggailo, n kilabe kingnei bamlie.” <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />RAMPAUBE Samuel dage rangdi, “Pielo, Ih au Israel ga ge mage teigai lai eh bam dida, cide siukelu leune mbeu dizie.” <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Cipau nai Ih Eli kilungme ha rang kegai leune tei zie, kerai gade kekam kecang. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Ih pa kemau ci kebam leune ziemne kelungta pe kilungme ha tiak zie rangbeu dida, kedanemene pe namedung penuikatei penui reu gage reset pung gwanggai kedine nah pa penuide kaamdi kemakne. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Aide ziemne pe kilungme mau madau gede ratak nah reca le tei ngngah gailak lie kecu Ih Eli kilungme dade a sam pet gaila. <verse eid="1SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samuel tingbaa kemaktane zeu bam; pecai pa cuhlwe RAMPAUBE ki kikamdung ngkeilu. Dede Samuel marengei ha de Eli dage ranglia kera ngngidi. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Cidau Eli Samuel de qugai eh rangdi, “A na, Samuel.” Samuel keligai, “Ih aika bam.” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Pa rangdi, “Pa n dage dai sam rang beu no? Kenggia eh a dade cide kebai diso. Tinggwang n dage rang kebeu samdung pelane nang a dade kebai dicai, pecu peu ncu saja siasüt eh peu lulo.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Samuel pe dage maleune rangbeu; pa pe dade magede kebai dima. Eli rangdi, “Cide au RAMPAUBE. Peu pecu petaube teilu.” <verse eid="1SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samuel ngkieng cuhlu, nah RAMPAUBE peda la, nah peu Samuel kerang leune teicang lu. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Israel pelane tingpeule Dan nam gade gwang tingpile Beersheba nam ga kecang Samuel de peu RAMPAUBE caihakecime ge tei kera kedet kelude cilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:20">Bat. 13:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />RAMPAUBE Shiloh gade pecu peu ngaugai dai, kedanemene pa Shiloh gade Samuel de pe sam gade liagai.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Samuel sam Israel pelane da gwanglu. Cidau Israelme Philistinme de ngngwa hereu tei kera miedi. Penui Ebenezer namdi gage ramzeuki teilu, nah Phiilistinme Aphek namdi gage ramzeuki teilu.<verse eid="1SA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Philistinme, Israel de ngngwa hereu tei kera sap bialu. Hereu teicuh ge, Philistinme Israel reu ngamlu, nah mipei cang mdai gede reutakbam gade teitsetdi. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Reugwame ramzeuki ga gwang luge, Israel muiteume rangdi, “Daitei RAMPAUBE henai peu Philistinme de anuide ngamdi no? Anui RAMPAUBE samkakbung de Shiloh gade aika pwa gwang lugo, iciu eh cide aika anui taiga bamlu nah cide anui ngauraume ba gade anuide kelilu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Cine penui mipeidung de Shiloh gage langgai; cikade penui Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pwalu, cherubim kena kakga kebam de. Eli napei kena, Hophni penai Phinehas cika Tinggwang samkakbung de taiga bam. <verse eid="1SA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />RAMPAUBE samkakbung de ramzeuki ga gwang luge, Israelme pelane penui suiyi kwa sahbak gai, ge hangdeube nlaidi. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Sah kebam kwade Philistinme siu luge, penui rangdi, “Hebrewme ramzeuki ga sah kebam kwade pekie daino?” Cidau penui RAMPAUBE samkakbung de ramzeuki ga gwangbam kedi cilu. <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Philistinme ngngidi eh penui rangdi, “Rabe ge ramzeuki ga gwang luda.” Penui rangdi, “Ainei, anui da keherei gwang zieda! Pedwa aikenzwa madau gede teima!” <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Ainei, anui da keherei gwang zieda! Caune anuide cipau kengkieng rabedung de ba gade kelibeu lai? Cidungde Egyptme de hetaideu gade keherei ketsamtsam le ngkap kecu rabedung de da. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Kuulu, nah mipei nzwalu, nnui Philistinmedung, mecai nnui Hebrewme baang tei zie, penui nnui baang tei kecu nzwa. Mipei nzwa regilu. <verse eid="1SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Philistinmedung regi eh Israelme de ngamlu. Mipei leune penui ki gage pak gaidi, nah kekiee gede daptsetdi; Israel hepi reugwame cang camrei ge kaudi. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Tinggwang samkakbung de tui teudi, nah Eli napei kena Hophni penai Phinehas tsaidi.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Benjamin leuhme pei ge reutakbam gade Shiloh gage pakgai eh cipaunai gage gwang cika canglu. Pe lungrei keulia kerane pe paini hietdi delwe pe peu ga tangnia kailu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Pa gwang cang luge, Eli Tinggwang samkakbung de ziemne pelung keherei eh lampui kungga pe bam ga ntum eh piebam. Cidau minabe namdi ga lütlwe sam paubeu, ge namdi ga minadung pelane hap cuhdi. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli kehap kwa siu keludau, pa keteudi, “Aipau mra kwade daino?” Mipeibe zette gwang Eli de gwang paubeu. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Cu Eli mmi riakhekui-hesetdi; nah pa pe miak mneidi eh mangau tadi.<verse eid="1SA 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philistinme samkakbung tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Mipeibe Eli dage rangdi, “Ih reutakbam gade gwang kelabe de delie. Ih henai hereu gade pak gwang luda.” Eli keteugai, “Dai nzwa dino, a napei?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Sam pau kebeube peide keligai, “Israelme Philistinme dade pak dida. Nah mina kekiee gede ngkap dida. Cirünne mene, n na kena, Hophni penai Phinehas de tsai dida, nah Tinggwang samkakbung de tuiteu pwa dida.” <verse eid="1SA 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Pa Tinggwang samkakbung ha rang kegai dau, Eli herieki taiga pebam gade kau tanglet miedi. Pe ngwang cumdi eh pa tsaidi, kedanemene pa cingdi nah pe zierüt kedine. Pa mmi riakdai ge Israel tutiak teigwang.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Cu pe napei, Phinehas nau, tetlak bam nah mna kera tingdi. Pa Tinggwang samkakbung de tui pwadi lie kecu nah pe pau penai pe nahpei tsaidi lie kecu sam siu luge, pa koktung mielwe mnalu, dede pe mna tetteei de teei zudi. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Pa tsaidi lai zeuge, pecu rengei kebam puidung rangdi, “Ngngi so, nang mipeina gede mna luda.” Dede pa sam keli mede penui rang kebamde gage pelung kailu tadi. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Pa henabe zi Ichabod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ichabod</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie Tinggwang kendu daiga lano?</char></note> msiaklu, “Kendu Israel dade tet dida!” de rang eh, Tinggwang samkakbung tuiteu kedine, nah pe pau penai pe nahpei tsai kedine. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Pa rangdi, “Kendu Israel dade tet dida, kedanemene Tinggwang samkakbung de tuiteu kedine.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Ashdod nah Ekron ga kebam samkakbung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Philistinme Tinggwang samkakbung de tuiteu kedicai, penui cide Ebenezer namdi gade Ashdod namdi gage pwagwang lu. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Philistinme Tinggwang samkakbung de Dagon kerecaki gage pwa gwanglu, nah cide Dagon mie tai gage kaidi. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Pecai benai tingcang nuge Ashdod ga minadung cuh luge, ainie, Dagon mie de RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwaga kaumie hangdeu ga pe zu ngkum bam. Cine penui Dagon miede pwalwe pebam gage kai daidi. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Dede pecai benai tingcang nuge penui cuh luge, ainie, Dagon mie RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwa ga kaumie hangdeu ga pe zu ngkum bam. Dagon peu nah pe ba kenana cum mpetlwe kimui tet kenlüt lampui ga mla bam. Dagon pe paube rünne bam. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Aide ziemne, henai kecang de Ashdod ga, Dagon cingkumedung nah Dagon ki ga gwang kela keheibe Dagon kimui tet kenlüt de ga penui pi dau lama.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Ashdod nam ga minadungde RAMPAUBE saja peu sütgai. Pa Ashdodme nah penuide twagwa kebam namdung de ngkapdi nah penuide keteeizam le teikeherei sütgai. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ashdod ga minadung cide tei kedi ngau luge, penui rangdi, “Israel Tinggwang samkakbung anui taiga bam dau lakta, kedanemene pa anuide nah anui rabe Dagon de saja peu zeu kecune.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Cine Ashdodme Philistia ga hegwang pelane de Ashdod gage qugai lu; penui penui dage rangdi, “Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de teu anui daitei laino?” Penui keligai, “Peu Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de Gath namdi ga pwagwang lu.” Cine penui Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de cika pwa miedi. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Dede penui cika pwagwang luge, RAMPAUBE namdibe de saja peugai, iciu eh penui peusui tei kegwak sütdi. Pa keteeizam le pwa Gath namdi ga minadung hena gade kecing kecang de teikeherei sütgai. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Cine penui Tinggwang samkakbung de Ekron nam gage langgai di. Dede Tinggwang samkakbung Ekron nam ga gwanglu herizi, Ekronme sah cuhdi, “Penui Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de anui nah anui minadung de teitsetdi kerane anuida pwagwang gaida.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Cine penui Philistiame gwangdung leune de qugai; penui penui dage rangdi, “Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de langgi dilu, nah peu cide pe deudi ga cailigwang dilu, iciude cide anuide nah anui minadung de teitsetdi melu kerane.” Tinggwang saja peu süt kegaine namdi leune ga kengngi bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Mina tsaidi kemakmedung de keteeizamdung le teikeherei sütgai, nah Ekronmedung hapkegai kwade tinggimdung ga nghangdi.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Samkakbung Israel da cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />RAMPAUBE samkakbung de Philistinme deudi ga kei hena ge bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Cidau Philistin ga minadung cingkumedung nah rekamedung de qugai; penui penui dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE samkakbung de teu anui daitei laino? Anui dainzwa cide pe deudi gage langcaili gai maisia bi ranglia lo.” <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Cingkumedung nah rekamedung keligai, “Nnui Israel Tinggwang samkakbung de langcaili dizie cai, mtamapeu gede si mene langgai so; kehei teide pecu kemau reca langgai beulu. Iciude nnui mateei yilu zie, nah daitei pa cu kecang nnuide saja peu bambi kecu nnui cilu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Cidau penui keligai, “Kemau reca ziemne anui pecu daipai langcaili beulai?” Penui keligai, “Philistia ga hegwang mengei ria gade kecak le teikelu keteeizam mengei nah kecak le teikelu za mengei. Mateei cide nnui nah nnui reu kedimedung de teikeherei kedine. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Cine nnui keteeizam rehidung, nah nnui heza hangdeu tei kemsiabe rehidung teilu maisia, delwe Israel Tinggwang de kendu peulu. Iciude pa nnuide, nnui rabedung nah nnui deude saja peu tadi lubui. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Pharaoh nah Egyptmedung penui nlung tak kedi nzwa daitei nnui nnui lung takbam laino? Israel Tinggwang penuide tei kehereisüt kegai dau; Egyptmedung minadung de lang gidi eh penui tetdi meni? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Cine cu, hekwen gari keheci ge nah ketumpui nciu pwa kebam madaude ngwanggai pung kemak kena telei lu. Ketumpui kenade gari gage keu gailu, dede penai na kena de hekaune ki gage kai dilu, penai dade peu tsam dilu. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Pecai RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pwalwe hekwen gari gage kailu, delwe pe petai ga, tsingbung ge gage nnui mau ziemne kemau reca pecu langgai beu lai eh kebam kecak rehidung de kailu. Pecai peu pesui lege tetgai dilu. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Pecai pielu; hekwen gari cide pe deu Beth Shemesh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beth Shemesh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie tingnaimiak ki.</char></note> nam nreule ge tetgai dicai, kengkap kedi aide tei kegai RAMPAUBE ne da. Dede ciciu mecai, Israelme Tinggwang ne anuide teikeherei melie kecu anui cilu zie; cide anuida gwangdau kelu geda.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Mipeidung penuide rang kebeunzwa teilu; penui nciu pwa kebam ketumpui kenade hekwen gari gage keu gailu, nah penai na kenade hekaune ki gage bangdi. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Penui RAMPAUBE samkakbung de hekwen gari de gage kailu, nah kecak za nah penui keteeizam rehi teikelude kaipwa kebam tsingbung de si eh. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ketumpui kena Beth Shemesh gage mzuizang eh tet gaidi. Penai puidiki gega mrung jüja tet nghang, nah penai zetle mede hile nreu pie ma. Philistinme reu kedimedung Beth Shemesh deurai kecang penai cai suimie. <verse eid="1SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Cu Beth Shemesh langkie ga minadung wheat luhlüt la, nah penui ngang cuh pie samkakbung de ngau luge, penui suiyi sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Hekwen gari de Beth Shemesh mepei Joshua luh ga gwanglu nah cika mtakdi. Cika tsurakang disüt ge bam, nah penui gari de gade tsing bi kecaidi delwe ketumpui kenade RAMPAUBE dage keru reca teigai beudi. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Levime RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pwa nghunglu, kecak miedung kebam tsingbung de si eh, delwe cidungde tsurakang disüt kecude reu gage kailu. Cipaunai Beth Shemesh ga mipeidung keru recadung nah ratakdung RAMPAUBE dage teigai beu. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Philistinme gwangpei hang mengei bau aide ngau luge, cipaunai penui tetcaili pwa Ekron ga gwangdi.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Philistinme kemau reca RAMPAUBE dage tei gaibeu kera ziemne kecak keteeizamdung langcaili kebeu aidungde da, Ashdod nam ziemne ket, Gaza nam ziemne ket, Ashkelon nam ziemne ket, Gath nam ziemne ket, nah Ekron nam ziemne ket. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Kecak za de au Philistia ga hegwangme hang mengei teu kebam namdi pelane, riekelu namdi nah renamdung de ziemne ramcau ge. Beth Shemesh mepei Joshua luh ga tsurakang kedide, penui RAMPAUBE samkakbung kai kecude, ndaa tei kedide zierang tei eh henai kecangde cika bam.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />RAMPAUBE Beth Shemeshme peidung gede teitsetdi, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE samkakbung lungga pie kegaine. Pa mipei hang riakhena gede teitsetdi. Minadung hei eh hap kedanemene RAMPAUBE cikenzwa ge mina dage tei kegaine. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Beth Shemeshme peidung rangdi, “Cau aipau kemci Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE dwaga saplu buino? Anui dade samkakbung de cau dage lang gaidi laino?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Penui Kiriath Jearim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kiriath Jearim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie tsingdung namdi. </char></note> ga kelungme dage samgwame langgai eh, ranggai, “Philistinme RAMPAUBE samkakbung teu cailigwang beuda; hung eh nnui pwa cailidai lulo.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Cine Kiriath Jearim ga minadung gwang RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pwalu, delwe lamlwatu ga lungh kebambe Abinadab ki gage pwa gwang gaidi. Penui pe napei Eleazar depeu RAMPAUBE samkakbung de rengei kerane tei mcilu.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samuel ne Philistinme de Mizpah gade ngamkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Samkakbung Kiriath Jearim ga peting ketie ge bamdi, mmi ngkai ge. Israelme pelane hei eh hapdi nah RAMPAUBE da nreugwang neudi. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samuel Israelme pelane dage ranggai, “Nnui nlung pelane teu RAMPAUBE da cailigwang lucai, nah nnui kakgade sangme rabedung nah herabe pui Ashtoreth recamiedung keu gidi, delwe RAMPAUBE dage nnui nlung nreulu eh pecu rünne recalu cai, ciciu lucai pa nnuide Philistinme ba gade kelibeu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Cine Israel ga minadung Baal nah Astarte miedung de keugidi delwe RAMPAUBE de rünne recadi. <verse eid="1SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Cidau Samuel rangdi, “Israelme pelane de Mizpah nam ga ngngwa gwang ngkwalu, nah Ih nnui ziemne RAMPAUBE dade kie zie.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Penui Mizpah ga ngkwalu, dui twaklu eh RAMPAUBE dwa gage ruigai beu. Penui cipaunai mmwang eh rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE dage kemau teigai dida.” Cikade Samuel Israelmedung ziemne kehebwak de teimci di nah minadung de teuswa beu. <verse eid="1SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Cu Israelme Mizpah ga ngkwa bam lie kecu Philistinme siu luge, Philistin gwangpeidung Israel de gwaketangdi. Israel ga minadung cide siu luge penui Philistinme de hingdi. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Cidau Israelmedung Samuel dage rangdi, “Anui ziemne RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dade kie mtakdi helo, ciude pa anuide Philistinme ba gade kelibeu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Samuel meurünna ge keulwe ruciau gai eh RAMPAUBE dage reca teigai beu. Cidau Samuel Israelme ziemne RAMPAUBE dage mragai nah RAMPAUBE pe kekie teibeu. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samuel keru reca tei kebamdau, Philistinme Israel de gwaketang kera tetcuh gai. Dede cipaunai RAMPAUBE Philistinme de mmau eh tingceu sütgai eh penuide kebwakdi, nah penui Israelme dwade pakdi. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Israelme Mizpah gade tetpet, nah penui Philistinme de Beth Kar ga kecang zuimie penuide teitsetdi.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Cidau Samuel tangtsu ge keulu delwe Mizpah penai Shen kakgage sum gaidi. Pa cide de Ebenezer<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ebenezer: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie kengha tsu.</char></note> msiaklu eh ranggai, “RAMPAUBE cu kecang anuide ngha beulie.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Cine Philistinme de ngamdi nah penui Israel deurai ga lütma. Samuel teilung pelane ga RAMPAUBE Philistinme de renia ladi. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Philistinme Israelme dade tuiteu kedi namdung de Israelme de peu kelibeudi, Ekron gade Gath kecang; Israelme penui deu Philistinme dade ngau dailu. Pecai Israel penai Amoritme kakga lungciep bamlu.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samuel pe teilung pelane Israelme reu tutiakme tei jüja gwang. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Pa mmi ramsang kum Bethel, Gilgal, nah Mizpah namdidung ga huigwangla. Pa heni aidung pelane ga Israel ziemne kehebwakdung teimci beula. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Pecai pa pe ki Ramah namdi ga cailigwang dila, nah cika de pa Israel ziemne kehebwakdung teimci beula. Pa cika RAMPAUBE ziemne recabam ge teibeu.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Israelme Hegwangpei ge kie kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samuel cing dige, pa na kena de peu Israelme reu tutiakme tei. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Pe neraibe zi Joel, nah pe napei pe kenabe zi Abijah. Penai Beersheba nam ga tutiakme tei. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Penai pe pei nzwa, dede masangkemak gie de zui ladi. Penai hetau henim lutyei nah makiedung masang eh nzangbeu tadi.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Cine Israel ga hangkiame pelane gwang ngkwalwe Ramah ga Samuel da gwang. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Ainie, nang cingdi dizeu da, nah n napei kena nang nzwa ma. Heleuh keda nzwa eh anui tu kerane anuide hegwang ge kedet beulo.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Dede penui, “Anuide hegwangpei ge peulo anui tutiak kerane,” de rang kegai dau, Samuel pe sui tadi. Cine Samuel RAMPAUBE dade kiedi. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />RAMPAUBE Samuel dage rangdi, “Minadung n dage kerangbe leune kingnei lulo. Penui ncu gidi kecube ma, dede penui acu penui gwangpei laklie mlai dida. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Ih penuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpetkelu benai gade penui ndaa nzwala dida, penui a dade nreutet dida nah hera kedadung de recala dida; nah penui cu n dage de cinzwa teigai zeu. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Cu penui kwa kingneilu; dede penuide mrairang mtingsüt beulu nah hengwangme penui reu dainzwa teu gwang ziebi kecu peu penuide cilu.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Cine Samuel minadung hegwangpei ge kie kebamme dage RAMPAUBE pe dage rang kebeu sam leune paubeu. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Pa rangdi, “Nnui reu hegwang tei kerabe de ainzwa tei zie. Pa nnui napeidung de peu pe bagidung teu zie nah pe bagi keteume teizie, nah pe bagidung dwaga pak zie. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Pa pe ziemne mina kangge de peu pecang reu nah riakngei reu kedime tei zie. Pa midungge de peu pe luh puu zie, midungge de pe mei luhlüt zie, nah midungge pe reunetdung tei zie nah pe bagi niadung tei zie. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Pa nnui napuidung de peu mariem kehengui keteime, malangme, nah tangku kerume tei zie. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Pa nnui luhdung yitube, kube luh nah olive luhdung luu luzie, nah cidungde pe kilame de peu dizie. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Pa nnui meiciu nah kubetsidung kereizige luulwe, pe kangga kedime nah pe kilamedung de peu dizie. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Pa nnui kilame pei nah kilame pui, gadadung nah ketum yitubedung luuteu dizie; delwe peu pe ta tei zie. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Pa nnui kauhaudung kereizige luupwa dizie, nah nnuide pe baangme tei dizie. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Cipau benai nnui ne kedetkelu hegwangpei de ziemne nnui ncam sütdi zie; dede RAMPAUBE cipaunai nnui sam keli beulak.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Dede minadung Samuel sam kingnei raudi; penui rangdi, “Lak! Anui reu hegwangpei ge bam maisia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:21">Bat. 13:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />iciu eh anuide heleuh kedadung nzwalu kerane, nah anui gwangpei anui tu tiak nah anui dwa tetpet eh anuide ngngwa hereu teilu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samuel mina samdung leune siu luge, pa cidungde RAMPAUBE dage pau beudi. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />RAMPAUBE Samuel dage rangdi, “Penui kwa kingneilu nah penuide hegwangpei ge peu lu.” Cine, “Mi leune de pe namdibe rip ga gwang dilu,” de eh Samuel Israelmedung de rang beudi.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Samuel ne Saul de keniak kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Benjamin leuh gade, mina kemlangme ge bamla. Pe zi cai Kish, pa Abiel napei, Zeror napei, Bekorath napei, Aphiah napei, Benjamin leuhme ge. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Pa pe napei pe zi Saul lie kecu ge bam, pa au hezu yisüt kecu rehang pei ge. Israelme kakga migede pa kenzwa hezu keyi gede gah. Pe Israel ga mikedame swade pera teiki. <verse eid="1SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Tingnaige Saul pei Kish gadadung gahdi. Cine Kish pe napei Saul dage ranggai, “Nang kilame gede ngngwalwe mie gadadung de peeilo.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Cine Saul Ephraim hangdeutu nam nah Shalishah cuikui kahgwang, dede penai cidungde de ngaulu ma. Cine penai Shaalim deu kahgwang dede cidungde de gah. Pecai penai Benjamin leuhme deu kahgwang dede penai cika cidungde de ngaulu ma.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Cidau penai Zuph cuikui ga gwang luge, Saul pecu ngngwa kela pe kilabe dage rang eh, “Ko, anai cailidai cugo, mevai a pei gadadungde nsungtadi eh anaide pelung pang bamzie delu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Dede kilabe keligai, “Ainei, namdi aika Tinggwang mina ge bam. Pecu mina leune rütla, pa kerang leune gwang kesangla. Anai cika miego; pa anai dailam ge tetgai maisia bi ranglia de cilak.” <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Cidau Saul pe kilabe dage rang eh, “Dede anai miecai, anai pecu dai teu gwang beulai? Kedanemene anai lamla ga taktyei bam meda, nah anai Tinggwang minabe de mapeu teugwang kera de gah. Anai da dai bamno?” <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Kilabe Saul sam keligai, “Aika, ada rangkanggeu shekel zi mdai zi ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">shekel zi mdai zi ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu keceu nage, perüt gram kecum ge.</char></note> bam, Ih cide Tinggwang minabe de peu zie, iciude pa anai dailam ge tetgai maisia bi ranglia zie.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Ndaa Israel ga, mige Tinggwang maci peei miecai, pa rangla, “Ko, anui kemcime da miego.” Kedanemene cidau caihakecime de kemcime lie qula.) <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Cidau Saul pe kilabe dage rangdi, “Rang dauda. Ko, anai mie cugo.” Cine penai Tinggwang minabe kebam namdi de ga miedi.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Cidau penai namdi be ga kideutu ga nghang ge, penai releimedung dui twak lai eh gwang kela ngaulu; Saul nah pe kilabe penui dage keteudi, “Kemcibe de bam mi?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Penui sam keligai, “Yeo, pa bam; pa nnai dwasiak gala. Kelwalu, pa henai namdibe ga gwangla, kedanemene henai minadung heni kecehu ga ratak teilai eh kebamne. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Nnai namdibe ga lüt herizi pecu ngau luzie, pa heni kecehu ga hang matyei di kemakne. Pa gwanglu kemaktane minadung matyei lak, kedanemene pa ne ratak de samlam beu zielu; pecai ne qu kegaimedung matyei zie. Cu nnai hang culo, iciude nnai pecu ngau zette luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Cine penai namdibe ga hangdi. Penai namdibe ga nlüt keladau, Samuel heni kecehu ga hang kerane penai taile gwangkela penai ngaulu.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Cu Saul gwang kemakdwa benai, RAMPAUBE Samuel dage liagai: <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Ncünne aipau tingdau Ih Benjamin deu gade mige de nda ge langgai zie, nah nang pecu a minadung Israel reu kedi tei kera keniak luzie. Pa a minadung de Philistinmedung ba gade kelibeu zie. Kedanemene Ih a minadung ngaunggia eh penui kengha kie kegai kwa siulu delu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samuel Saul de ngau luge, RAMPAUBE pe dage rangdi, “Ih ndage rang kebeu de aipau deda! Pa a mina reu kengkieng teulai eh kebambe deda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Cidau Saul herieki ga Samuel taiga gwang keteudi, “Kemcibe de ki daiga bambi acu ranglia lo?” <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samuel Saul sam keligai, “Ih kemcibe da. Kecehu niga a dwarai hang cu, kedanemene nnai henai acu ngngwa matyei zie. Tingcang ne Ih nnai depeu tetzie, nah Ih nnai cet kebam pelane ranglia beuzie. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />N Gadadung lang cumne gah kedidung de ziemne nlung keherei so, kedanemene cidungde de ngaulu delu. Ciude Israelme pelane keregui cau da bam no? Nang nah n kilungme Israelme pelane kereguibe delie Ih rang gaila.” <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Saul sam keligai, “Ih au Benjamin leuhme, Israel leuh gade heleuh ceutunabe, nah a kelak au cipau pautsa gade ceutunabe! Nang daitei a dage ainzwa rangzeu no?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Pecai Samuel Saul nah pe kilabe de ngngwalwe kibung gega gwanglu, nah penaide peu hegiame kakga heni raitube ga bamlu, penui mina camrei kenzwa ge. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samuel malangbe dage rangdi, “Ih ncu kaintsam lulo pwapeu kedi qwade pwa gwanglu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Cine malangbe pe mnie nah cika kebamde Saul dwa gage kaibeu. Cidau Samuel rangdi, “Pielo, aide n ziemne kaipwa kebam deda. Tyei lu, cide peting riet pwa kebam de ga ncu peu hegiame de ngngwa tyei kerane n ziemne kainzeu delu.” Cine Saul cipaunai Samuel de ngngwa matyei.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Penai kereca ni gade renam ga cailigwang luge, Samuel Saul de kireu ga ngngwa hanglu nah cika pe ziemne zeu ge mtei beu. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Pecai benai tingcang nuge, Samuel Saul kireu gage kebambe de qugai, “Cuhlu, Ih ncu n lampui gage langgai beuzie.” Cine Saul cuhlu, nah Samuel penai puidiki ga ngngwa miedi. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Penui renam tu ga gwang luge, Samuel Saul dage rangdi, “Kilabe de anai dwa rai gwang culo rang beulo, nah cine pa tetnswadi, dede nang aika tingkakge bam maisia, iciude Ih Tinggwang sam n dage rang beulu kerane.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Cidau Samuel macabung ge pwalwe cide Saul peu gage ruigai, nah pecu kemam gai. Pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ncu peu pe mina Israel reu kedi tei kera keniaklu de meni? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuagint (Greek Laisiukwak) ga, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nang RAMPAUBE minadung reu di zie nah penuide penui ngauraumedung dade kelibeu zie. Aide RAMPAUBE ncu peu pe mina reu kedi tei kera kedet kelu n ziemne zasi ge zie, de rau pwala.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Nang henai acu pütdi eh tetde, Benjamin deu Zelzah lie qu kela ni ga Rachel rau tai gade nang mi hangna de redau zie. Penai n dage rangzie, ‘Nang gada peei keladung de ngau luda. Cu n pei gadadung de ziemne pelung pang meda, nah n ziemne pelung pang eh keteu, “Ih a napei ziemne dai tei zieno ?”’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Pecai nang cikade tet jüja mie zie, nah nang Tabor heni ga mhu bang de ga gwanglu zie. Nang cika de mina hangcum Bethel namdi ga Tinggwang da miekela redau zie, hangge hemeu keceuna kecum pung lazie, kedage tangku kwak cum pung lazie, nah kedage cai teigeu la zau pung lazie. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Penui ncu kelum zie nah ncu tangku kwak kena peu zie, nang cide penui ba gade keu luzie. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Cipau cai nang Tinggwang deutu ga gwang zie, Philistinme reugwame kebam ni ga. Nang cipau namdi be ga gwang kelu dau, nang caihakecime heni kehu gade penui gu harp ge, kehediang bung ge, terwaine ge, nah lyre penui dwa pwa lwe nghung kela dau hema gede dauzie; penui caihasam rang bamzie. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />RAMPAUBE rabe nreu ga zette gwang zie, nah nang penuide ngngwa caihasam rang zie, nah ncu kedipwa mi kecamme ge dizie. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Cu, marehi aidungde nda gwang lude, n ba tei kera leune kengaube tei lulo, kedanemene Tinggwang ncu ngngwabam kelane. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Gilgal nam ga a dwarai nghung bamlu. Cidau Ih n taiga keru recadung teibeu kera nghung zie nah lungciep ratak recadung. Lang hena ne kwa bamlu Ih nda gwang eh nang daipai tei maisiabi ncu sauliabeu kemak tane.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul depeu hegwangpei teikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Saul Samuel dade tetnreu dige, Tinggwang pecu nlung keheci ge peu. Cidau aidung pelane marehidung cipaunai teigwang cangdi. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Penui kideutu ga gwang luge, caihakecime maa ge pecu redaulu, nah Tinggwang rabe pe reuga kelwa gwangdi ciude pa penuide ngngwa caihasam ranglu kerane. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Ndaa pecu cibam kela leune pecu caihakecime de ngngwa eh caihasam rang kebam ngau luge, minadung hangge ge da rangdi, “Kish napei de dai teidi dino? Saul cu au caihakecime ge di deni?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mige heni cika lungh bam kelame ge keli eh cuh, “Ciucai penui peidung cau gamme kerabe no?” Kedanemene aide ziemne, ainzwa rangla di “Saul de caihakecime mi hangge deni?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Pa caihasam rangcang dige, pa heni kecehu ga nghang di.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Cidau Saul pei sinabe pecu nah pe kilabe dage rang eh, “Nnai daiga miela no?.” Pa samkeli eh, “Gadadung de peei la. Anai cidung de ngauluta dige, anai Samuel da mie.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Saul pei sinabe rangdi, “Samuel ncu dai ranglia bi kehereide acu ranglia lo.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Saul pe pei sinabe samkeli eh “Gadadung de ngaulu de lie kecu pa anaide pecu ranglia mcibeu.” Dede hegwangram ha Samuel kerangde pa pecu ranglia ma.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Cu Samuel minadung de RAMPAUBE dwa Mizpah ga ge qu hekwa lu. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Pa Israelme mina dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang ainzwa rangla: ‘Ih Israelme de Egypt gade ngngwampet lu, nah Ih nnuide Egyptme ba gade kelilu, nah nnuide tei keherei kela hegwangram pelane ba gade kelilu.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Dede henai nnui Tinggwang de püt dida, Pa nnuide kehereiting nah lungreidung pelane gade kelibeu; nah nnui pecu rang eh, ‘Anui reuga hegwangpei ge tei beulo.’ Cu nnui katei RAMPAUBE dwaga pe leuh rip nah pautsa rip tei eh ngkwalu.” <verse eid="1SA 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Cine Samuel Israel leuhme pelane de ngngwa gwang nnalu, nah Benjamin leuhme de kedetlu. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Pecai Samuel Benjamin leuh de penui pautsadung gade ngngwa gwang mnalu, nah Matri pautsa de kedetlu; nah Kish napei Saul de kedetlu. Dede penui pecu peei kemiedau, pecu ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Cidau minadung Tinggwang dage madung keteu si neudi, “Mi keda cude gwang kera bamreu ni?” RAMPAUBE keli eh, “Pa pekatei pecu maniadung kakga kebaih pwabam.” <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Cidau penui pakmie Saul de cika de teu gwanglu. Pa mina kakga sap kegaidau, pe hekeutu nreu gade Israelme swade huki di. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Cidau Samuel minadung dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ne kedet kelube minabe de nnui ngau mi? Mina leune kakgade pa kenzwa cika migede gah!” Mina pelane sahgai, “Hegwangpei depeu ringtie lo!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Cidau Samuel ranglia minadung dage hengwangme ge teikela zaidung nah hezaidung, laisiukwak ge gage cidungde raulu, nah cide RAMPAUBE dwa gage kaidi. Samuel pecai mina pelane de langgi di, mina hange ge de pe ki riep gage langgai di. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Saul de pe ki Gibeah ga gwangdi, nah mina kengkiengme, penui nlung Tinggwang ne tung kegaime, pecu ngngwa nzang miedi. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Dede minadung kesiamedung kangge rangdi, “Dainzwa mina aipau de anuide kelilu lai?” Mina aidung de Saul de mlaidi nah pecu mta mapeudung gede teu gwang beu ma. Dede Saul nlei ma.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Saul ne Jabesh namdi keli kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Pecai Ammonme gwangpei Nahash mie delwe Jabesh Gilead namdi de gwa lu. Jabesh nam ga mina pelane Nahash de rangdi, “Anuide ngngwa samkak lu, nah anui n gwatei luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Hegwangpei Nahash, Ammonme pei sam keli eh, “Ainzwa lu zie cai Ih nnuide ngngwa samkak lu zie, peu acu nnui pelane zetle miakdung let mpet cai, nah ainzwa eh Israel reu hengam keu gwang lu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Cidau Jabesh namdi ga hangkiame pecu keli eh, “Lang hena ne ziemne anui de püt beu lo, iciu de anui Israel deu pelane ga samgwame langgai beu lu kerane. Ciciu eh, migede de anuide keli beu kera gah di cai, anui n kang nlüt zie.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Jabesh gade samgwamedung Saul lungh kebam, Gibeah namdi ga gwanglu, nah dai teidi dibi minadungde paulia. Ciu eh mina pelane hapsüt di. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Cu Saul hetumseudung caisui eh luh gade mpet di. Saul rangdi, “Dai ge mau di eh minadung hap bam no?” Penui Jabesh ga minadung ne rang kebeu de peda pau beu.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Saul penui kerang de siu luge, Tinggwang Rabe pereu ga zette gwang di nah pa pe rata süt di. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Pa hetumseu ngwanggai de pwalu, dang kecai lu, nah Israelme deu pelane gage samgwame dage lang gai. Pa rangdi, “Saul nah Samuel caisui kemakme tumseudung de aiciu beu zie.” Cidau RAMPAUBE ne keheu kegai de minadung reu gwang di, nah penui pelane mi hangge nzwa ngngwa tet petlu. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Pa penuide Bezek namceu ga ge peu ngkwalu ge, Israelme mina cang hai cum, nah Judahme cang camrei bam. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Penui samgwame gwang kebamme dage rangdi, “Nnui Jabesh Gilead dage rangzie, ‘Ncünne, tingna tingding, nnuide kelilu zie.’” Cine samgwame mie Jabesh ga minadung de rangbeu, nah penui suiyi di. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Cidau Jabesh ga minadung Nahash da rang eh, “Ncünne anui nda nlüt zie da, nah nang cet eh n ziemne dai yizie bie anui dage teigai lubui.” <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Pecai benai Saul reugwame de nzipwa maa cum teilu, penui tingcang nuge ramzeuki sum ga paklüt, nah penui Ammonme de gwaketang eh tingna dauge ngkienglu. Ring kebammedung zangra di, ciu eh mi hangna gede ngngwa ket tei eh tet tadi.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul de hegwangpei kera mpau daikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Cidau minadung Samuel dage rangdi, “Saul anui reu di zie ni? ‘De rang kecube de caudung no?’ Penuide ngngwa gwang lo, anui penuide daptset dizie.” <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Dede Saul rang eh, “Mige de de henai daptset lak, kedanemene henai RAMPAUBE Israel de kelibeu delu.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Pecai Samuel minadung dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, anui Gilgal ga mie hegwangpei de tei heci dai go.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Cine mina pelane Gilgal ga mie RAMPAUBE dwa gade Saul de hengwang tei gai. Cika Gilgal gade penui lungciep ratak RAMPAUBE dwa gage teigai, Saul nah Israelme leune penui sui yisüt lu.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samuel sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samuel Israelme pelane dage rangdi, “Ih nnui a dage rang kegaidung de siu luda, nah Ih nnui reu hengwang tei kera ge de kedet luda. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Cu, aika au hegwangpei nnui dwaga tet gwang bam dida, Ih au cing nah a peu pu dida, nah a napeidung nnui kakga bam. Ih a rehang ting gade henai kecang nnui dwa tetgwang dida. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Ih aika bam, acu mmaulu RAMPAUBE dwa gade nah pa ne keniakkelu hegwangpei dwa gade. Ih caudung ge gu hetumseu luupwa di no? Ih caudung gu gada luupwa dino? Ih caude cwa di no? Ih caude mneu dino? Caudung ge ba gade hetau henim keuno Ih? Acu mmaulu, ciude Ih cidungde nnuide pwa peudai dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:33">Bat. 20:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Penui keligai, “Nang anuide cwa ma, anui suisiet teima, mede nang mige ba gade magede rega nzeu ma.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ne n zierang da, nah pa ne keniakkelu hegwangpei de henai pe zierang da, a ba ga magede tei mau nzeu kemak nang kengau de.” Penui sam keli di, “RAMPAUBE ne zierangbe da.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samuel minadung de rangsi eh, “RAMPAUBE ne Moses nah Aaron de kedet kelube da, nah nnui paumedung de Egypt deu gade ngngwa mpet kelube. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Cine cu, gwanglu nnui, iciude Ih RAMPAUBE dwa gade nnuide rangmsialu kerane RAMPAUBE masang tadung leune de, nnui nah nnui paumedung ziemne pa tei kegaidung. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Jacob Egypt ga gwang keludau, nah nnui paume RAMPAUBE dage kie kegaidau, cidau RAMPAUBE Moses nah Aaron de langgai, penai ne ngngwa mpetlu nnui paume de Egypt gade nah penui heni aika lungh di. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Dede penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de nsungtadi. Cine pa Siserame, Hazorme reugwa kedibe nah Philistinme nah Moabme gwangpei ba gage kaigai beudi. Penui pelane nnui paume de ngngwa regi eh gwang. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Nnui paumedung RAMPAUBE dage hap eh rangdi, ‘Anui mau dida, kedanemene anui RAMPAUBE dade nreudi delu nah Baal penai Ashtoreth mamie de recadi delu. Dede cu anuide kelibeu lo anui ngauraume ba gade, nah anui n gwatei zie.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Cine RAMPAUBE Jerub Baal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gideon</char></note> Bedan, Jephthah nah Samuel de langgai beu eh nnui ngauraume ncu twagwa kebam leu reu peu ngkieng lu, ciu eh peu nnui de lungh kwak lu kerane. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Nnui Nahash, Ammonme gwangpei nnuide regi kera lüt kecu ngau kelu dau, nnui ada ge rangdi, ‘Lak! Ciuliede, hegwang ge anui reu kedi bam maisia’, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, nnui gwangpei liede. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Cu nnui kedet kelube hegwangpei de aika bamda, nnui kie kegaibe de, nah cu RAMPAUBE nnui reu hegwang tei kera kedetkelube de. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Nnui RAMPAUBE mie hing liecai, pe gwatei lu, pe sam mzailu nah RAMPAUBE ajadungde de renia diso, iciude nnuide nah nnui gwangpei kengkieng keteube n RAMPAUBE Tinggwang caisuime teilu zie. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Magade nnui RAMPAUBE kerang kwade mzai ma, dede RAMPAUBE sam kaikebeu de mlai dicai RAMPAUBE de nnuide mlai dizie, nnui paumedung dede mlai kedinzwa. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Cu de nnui RAMPAUBE da gwang lu, nah RAMPAUBE makedi aide nnui miak dwa gade teigai lai eh kebam de pielu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Henai wheat luhlüt kecu ting meni? Ih RAMPAUBE dage kie gai zie, ciude pa tingceu nah tingrui langgai kerane. Pecai nnui kemau kedi teidi delie kecu ci nah ngaulu zie, nnui RAMPAUBE dwade tei kedi de, nnui ziemne hegwang ge kie kegai de.” <verse eid="1SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Cine Samuel RAMPAUBE dage qugai, nah cipau nai RAMPAUBE tingceu nah tingrui kekiee ge langgai beu. Ge mina cika kebamme pelane RAMPAUBE penai Samuel de hing süt di.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Cidau Samuel dage minadung pelane rangdi, “N kilamedung ziemne RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang dade kie gai lo, ciude anui tsaidi melu kerane. Kedanemene anui maudung pelane gage kaisi dai luda, anui ziemne hegwang ge kie eh.” <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samuel keli gai, “Ngngi di so, nnui tsaidi lak. Nnui kemau cikenzwa tei di lie de, RAMPAUBE dade nreu tet diso, dede RAMPAUBE de nnui mlung pelane teu pegwa teilu. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Kemtadung mamiedung nnuide ngha beu mede keli gai kelakbedung caisui so, kedanemene cidungde au pemi gahlu. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Pe zi kedi de ziemne, RAMPAUBE pe minadung de gidi lak, kedanemene pa nnuide pe mina tei kera pelung gade tiaklu delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />A ziemne au, Ih nnui ziemne kie tadi eh RAMPAUBE dage kemau teigai kerabe ma. Meliene, Ih nnuide daipai be yi nah petau bi kecube lampui ledeu beuzie. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />RAMPAUBE de rünne hinglu nah nnui mlung pelane teu kesangbe gade pegwa teilu. Pa nnui ziemne ma kedi tei kegaidung de nsung lu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Dede nnui kesiabe tadung tei jüja lacai, nnui nah nnui gwangpei de ngkapdi zie.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Samuel ne Saul de kehesiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Saul hegwang tei mdeu keludau mmi camrei di<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmi camrei demi kecu cisiakte luma. </char></note>, nah pa Israel reu mmi riakdai hegwang tei, <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Saul Israelme mipei cang cum kedet lu, Cang na petai ga bam lu Michmash namdi ga nah hangdeutu deudi Bethel ga, cang ge Benjamin leuhme deu ga Gibeah ga Jonathan taiga bam di. Reugwame kedame de penui kilung gage lang gaidi, pe paiki riep gage. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Geba ga Philistinme ramzeuki ga reugwame de Jonathan nah pe reugwame ne ngamlu nah Philistinme cide pelane siulu. Ge Israel deudi reu pelane gage telui kwa gai, ge Saul rangdi, “Peu Hebrewme dungde siu lulo.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Israelme pelane de Saul Philistinme ramzeuki reugwame de ngamlu delie kecu siulu, nah iciu eh Israelme Philistinme ngkau ge teidi. Pecai reugwamedung de Gilgal gade Saul da gwanglu lo de qu hekwa gai.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Philistinmedung Israelme de ngngwa keregi kera ngkwalu, penui bagidung cang cum, bagidung teu kerame cang herok nah reugwame jaadi kedi kung ga heciangdung kieege nzwa. Penui Michmash Beth Aven kepetle bie hang ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Ge Israelme penui kerehim bam kedi ngau lu eh, penui swa gadi, penui tsupop gadung, mapuikangdung, tsurakang kak gadung, tekwadung nah hekwakidung ga mbai di. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Hebrewme kangge Jordan kah lu eh Gad nah Gilead deudung ga ladi. Dede Saul cidau Gilgal ga lareu, nah mina maa pelane mbeu eh pe caisui ladi.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Pa lang henane kwa lu, Samuel peting riet kebeu de nzwa. Dede Samuel Gilgal ga gwang lu tadi, nah minadung Saul dade zangpet cudi. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Saul rangdi “Acu keru reca nah kezuyi recadung teu gwang beulo,” ciu eh pa keru ratak tei gai. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Pa keru ratak teicang lu siakge Samuel gwanglu. Saul pecu redau kerane petlu nah pecu kelum gai. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Pecai Samuel rangdi, “Nang dai teidi deno?” Saul keligai, “Minadung acu gidi zeu kecu ngaugai nah nang riet kenzeu be ting ga gwang canglu ma, nah Philistinme Michmash ga gwang ngkwa bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />Ih rangdi, Philistinme acu aika Gilgal renia nghung zieda nah Ih RAMPAUBE sui ci luma, cine Ih keru ratak ge teigai maisia de lie eh teidi.” <verse eid="1SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Ge Samuel Saul dage rangdi, “Nang kemie ta ge tei dida. Nang RAMPAUBE, n Tinggwang ncu aja kai kebeu de mzailu meda. Ciciu lude RAMPAUBE n kedi kelungta Israel reu peu bam luzie nage. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Dede cu au n kedi bam jüja gailakta, RAMPAUBE pa pesuibe ge de peei luda, nah RAMPAUBE pecu peu pe minadung reu di kera kedetlu da, kedanemene nang pa aja kai kebeu de mzai lu ta kedine.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Bat. 13:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ge Samuel cuhlu delwe Gilgal gade Benjamin deu Gibeah ga nghang di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:15">Ge Saul minadung petai ga kebam hai herok kenzwa gede pei hekwalu.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israelme hereunet sikemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saul, pe napei Jonathan nah minadung pe taiga kebamme Benjamin leuhme deu Gibeah ga bamdi. Dede Philistinme ramzeuki Michmash ga bam. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Philistinme reugwadung maa cum tei eh ramzeuki gade gwang. Maa ge Shual deu ga Ophrah namdi lam miedi. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Keda maa Beth Horon namdi lambie nreutet di, nah keda maa Zeboyim Langkam nah hetaideu kengau lebie miedi.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Israel pelane ga hegeu ta keteime de ngau luma, kedanemene Philistinme rangdi, “mecai peu Hebrewme de kingtie nah hengei penuikatei ziemne tei bam zie de nage.” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Dede Israelme penui hepei, tsinghang, nreu nah tangkane mui tei kera Philistinme da mie la. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Hepei nah tsinghang mui tei kecu shekel zicum gade zina keula, nreu mui nah hetumhepei tei nzui kera shekel zicum gade zige keula. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Cine hereu ketei benai, reugwame mige ba gade kingtie mede hengei gah Saul penai Jonathan de ngngwa kelame; Saul nah pe napei Jonathan katei bam.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonathan Philistinme de gwaketang kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Philistinme ramzeuki reugwame mie Michmash gicak de kwalu.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Tingnai ge, Jonathan Saul napei pe reunet pwakelabe rehangbe dade rangdi, “Anai Philistinme ramzeuki ga kahpet go lie.” Dede Jonathan pe pei de ranglia ma. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Saul Gibeah gade mdei kemak Migron ga kuraletsi bang kang ga bam. Pa mina hai herok kenzwa ge ngngwala. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Cidung kakga Ahijah cingkupei hekeutupai kai kelabe, Ichabod sinabe Ahitub napei, pa Phinehas napei nah Shiloh ga RAMPAUBE cingkupei Eli tsapei. Reugwame Jonathan tetkedi cima. <verse eid="1SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Michmash gicak, Philistinme ramzeuki ga gwang kerane Jonathan kah gwang kera dega, tsurakang kedi kena gicak lule ailam tu bam. Ket te Bozez<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide pekie mzai kecu</char></note> lie qula nah kedabe de Seneh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide pekie petu ketei </char></note> lie qula. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Ket gicak tingtünle bam, Michmash ncwa eh, kedabe de tingbangle bam, Geba ncwa eh.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Jonathan pe reunet pwakelabe rehangbe dade rang eh, “Kau, anai hegeurumkemak medung ramzeuki ga kahpet pie go. RAMPAUBE anai keleu gade heta tei beu de cilak, mage nede RAMPAUBE de kam mzeu gailak mide kelibeu kerane mina kiee mede cam liede.” <verse eid="1SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Pe reunet pwakelabe rehangbe de keli di, “N mlung gade tei neu kela bedung teiciak lulo. Mie nswa culo, ainie, Ih au ncu ngngwa la, nang tei lo kebeubedung mzai ciak kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Ge Jonathan rangdi “Anai tet kahpet zie da delwe peu Philistinme de anaide ngau gai zie da. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Penui anaide, cika gwang cang kemaktane kwa lulo di cai, anai kahpet mene anai bam ga bam dizie. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Dede penui keli cai, ‘Anui tai ga gwang lu,’ ciucai anai kahpet luzie; kedanemene cide RAMPAUBE anai de penui reu ngkieng kelu kepeu marengei gelu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Cine penai Philistinme de penai de peu ngaugai, Philistinme rangdi, “Pielo, Hebrewme penui mbaibam gade mpet zeu da.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Cine ramzeuki ga minadung Jonathan nah pe reunet pwa kelabe de qu eh rangdi, “Anui tai ga nghang lu, nah anui nnai dage mage pwalia zie.” Jonathan pe reunet pwa kelabe dage rangdi, “Acai suilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israel de penui reu kengkieng peu dida.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Jonathan nra nghang di, nah pe reunet pwakelabe rehangbe de pecai sui lu. Jonathan pedwa ga kela Philistinme de teitset di nah pe reunet pwa kelabe pecai gade midung ge de teitset lu. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Gitset kerai be gade Jonathan penai pe reunet pwa kelabe mina hang ngkai gede gidi, deukui acre pempie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide au langnaige gage relui kena ne luh puhlu kera ge luhpak di ge.</char></note> nage gade. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Cika ramzeu ki ga, luh ga nah minadung kakga tei ngngi di. Ramzeuki nah gwakelütme de ngngi di. Nnuiteudi nah cika ngngi süt bamdi.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Benjamin deu Gibeah ga Saul pumkwame, Philistinme reugwame lule ailam pak nlüt mpet kebam ngau bam di. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Cine Saul minadung de ngngwa kebam dage rangdi, “Peilo delwe caube anui kak gah bi kecu pielo.” Cidau penui peipie ge, Jonathan penai pe reunet kepwabe de gahdi. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Saul Ahijah dage rangdi, “Aika Tinggwang samkakbung de keu gwang lu,” kedanemene cidau ting cide Israelme da la. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Saul cingkupei de mpau kebam dau, Philistinme ramzeuki ga ma kebwak bam jüja nah kie reureu bamdi. Cine Saul cingkupei dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE de resiu bam kera ting gah da” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Saul nah minadung Philistinme de ngngwa kebamme hereu ga miedi. Philistinme penui katei kakgade ma kebwak süt eh hangge ge de keregi bam. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Ndaa Hebrewme kangge Philistinme lam ngngwa kelame, nah penuide ngngwa ramzeuki ga mie kedime, penui Saul penai Jonathan de ngngwakela Israelme de ngngwa ncütlu. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Israel ga minadung Ephraim deutudung ga mbai kebamme Philistinme pak tet di zeu lie kecu siukelu dau, penui de hereu ga penuide gwa mie. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Cine RAMPAUBE cipau nai Israel de kelilu, nah Beth Aven swa gade hereu kah miedi.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonathan heliadui ketyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Cipau nai Israelme mneidi kedanemene Saul minadung de sampet ge kaigai nah rangdi, “Ih a ngauraume dade hekum pei lu kemakne henai matyei kecube keheibe de reset pung lulo”. Cine reugwame migede taktyei msi ma. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ge penui pelane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Deudi ga mina pelane</char></note> hegung ga lüt nah cika hangdeu ga heliadui bam. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Minadung hegung ga lüt keludau heliadui puibam, dede mige de pemui gage kai ma kedanemene penui reset de hing kedine. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Dede Jonathan pe pei minadung de sampet kai kenzeude siu ma. Pa hetuitie pe ba ga pwa kelade hetwa pwa heliaduilip gage keci gai. Pa peba keu ncuh pe mui gage kailu, ge pa pe miak nrakpetlu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa pe kengkieng ngau dailu</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Ge reugwame kakgade mige Jonathan dage keligai, “N pei anui dage samkak mtingsüt eh kainzeu pwabam, rang eh, ‘henai migede matyei kecube peu reset pung lulo,’ minadung nzeu nah mnei ciau bamde.” <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Ge Jonathan rangdi, “A pei anui deu gage makennang teigai. Pielo, Ih heliadui nsi kelune daikenzwa gede Ih a miak nrakpet silu de bi. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Henai minadung penui ngauraume dade tui keludung de tyeilu liecai, daikenzwa gede yiki zieno? Kedanemene Philistinme de gi kie lu meda.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Cipaunai penui Michmash gade Aijalon ga kecang Philistinme de keregi mie. Israel reugwamedung leu sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Penui tui keludung gage pak gai, meurün, hetumseu nah hetumnadung cika de daptset lu. Penui cika de cidungde tyeilu hejaidung si eh. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Ge penui Saul dage rangbeu, “Pielo, minadung hejaidung si eh tyei eh RAMPAUBE dage kemau tei gai bam dida.” Saul rangdi, “Nnuide nlum gaikelak ta tei dida. Cu tangtsukang kedi ge aika acu kela gwang beulo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Saul rangdi, “Minadung kakga mie cu delwe penuide ranglia beulu, ‘Peu mi keheibe de de pe tumseu nah pe meuründung aika teu gwang daptset lwe tyei zie. Hejai tyei si eh RAMPAUBE dage kemau tei gai di so.’” Cine cipau ziu penui pe tumseu riep teugwang lwe daptset lu. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Saul RAMPAUBE dage recabam ge tei gai beu, pa cide recabam tei beu raitube.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Ge Saul rangdi, “Anui tingmui gage Philistinme de gwaketang eh tingcang kemaktane penuide ngkap nah penui pelane de teitset di go.” Penui sam kelidi, “N kecet gade yi tube tei lulo.” Dede cingkupei rangdi, “Anui Tinggwang suibe keteu raitu ge lo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Saul Tinggwang de keteu, “Ih Philistinme de gwaketang zie ni? Nang Israelme de ngkieng kelu peu zie ni?” Dede cipau nai Tinggwang pe sam keli beu ma <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Ge Saul rang eh, “Nnui mina muiteumedung aika gwang; henai aipau kemau daipai tei di de bi ci nah pie lulo. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Cine, Israelme de keli beu kelabe, ring kela RAMPAUBE, Jonathan a napei liede, pa tsai bizie. Dede migede mina pelane kakga de pecu sam keli ma.” <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Pecai pa Israelme pelane dage ranggai, “Nnui pelane tu ge lam pet sap lu, Ih nah Jonathan a napei anai keda lebie sap luzie.” Penui Saul dage rang eh, “N kecet gade dai yitu bi tei lulo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Saul rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang! Aipau mau de Ih ne mede a napei Jonathan ne tei liecai, RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Urim de peu gailo. Dede aipau kemau de n minadung Israel ne tei gai liecai, Thummim de peu gailo.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew laisiukwak ga </char><char style="fqa">acu samli petaube peulo, de eh bam</char>. </note> Cidau Jonathan nah Saul de peu dacak tei, dede reugwame be nzeu lu. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Cidau Saul rangdi, “A napei Jonathan anai kakga peu dacak lo.” Cidau Jonathan ne dacak be keulu.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Cidau Saul Jonathan dage rangdi, “Nang daipai ge tei di bi acu ranggai lo”. Jonathan pe dage rang beu, “Ih heliadui nage msi dida a ba ga kebam tsingtie tün ga taulwe. Ih aika bam da, Ih tsai zie da.” <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Saul rangdi, “Jonathan, nang tsai mecai peu Tinggwang de acu teitset di lu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Cidau minadung Saul dage ranggai, “Jonathan Israelme de ngkiengkelu kedi aide teu gwang kebeube depeu tsaidi zieni? Ring kela RAMPAUBE zi teu eh pe peutam lei nage de hangdeu ga cakmie dilak lie, pa henai tei kegaide Tinggwang ngha teu eh teida”. Cine mina Jonathan tsai kera gade kelilu. <verse eid="1SA 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Pecai Saul Philistinme de gwa zui si tadi, nah Philistinme penui deurai ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Saul Israel ga hegwang tei luge, pa kehei ga pe ngauraume de ngngwa keregi. Moabme, Ammonme, Edomme, Zobah gwangpeidung, nah Philistinme. Pa nreu kegai leune ga pe ngauraume de saja peu. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Pa kuu süt eh keregi eh Amalekme reu ngkienglu. Penui ngauraume leune dade de pa Israelme de kelibeu.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul kelak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Saul napeidung au Jonathan, Ishvi, nah Malki-Shua. Pe napui neraibe zi Merab nah Michal, henabe pui. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Saul nau zi Ahinoam; pa Ahimaaz napui. Pe reugwame reu kedibe zi Abner, Ner napei, Saul pei swa kecingbe. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kish au Saul pei; nah Ner, Abner pei, Abiel napei.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Pe teilung tane Saul Philistinme de ngngwa keregi gwang. Saul mi kengkieng mede kekuu gede ngaulu ge, pa pecu peu pe reugwame ge teidi la.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">RAMPAUBE Saul de pütkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samuel, Saul dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ne acu langgai la, ncu keniak pwa pe mina Israelme reu hegwang tei kerane. Cine cu RAMPAUBE samdung kingnei lu. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Ainzwa reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rangla, ʻIh Amalek ne Israel dage lampui ga kela dau penui de renia eh dai teigai bi ci luda, penui Egypt gade gwahang keladau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Exo. 17:8-13, Deu. 25:17-19</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Cine cu n reugwame de teuswalu delwe Amalekme de gwaketang eh penui gu kebam leune ngkap zing dilu. Ma gede bangbeu so; mipei nah mipui, hename nah ngiena, hetum nah meurün, ut nah gadadung pelane de teitset di.”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Saul minadung de qu hekwalu nah penuide Telaim namdi gade pie, mipeime cang haina hepi ketetme nah Judahme peidung cang kerei bam. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Pecai Saul pe mina de ngngwa Amalek namdi ga mie langkam gade kwabam. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Cidau Saul Kenitme dage rangdi, “Nnui Amalekme kak gade tetdilu, ciude Ih penuide ngkap kecudau nnuide ngkapdi melu kerane. Kedanemene Israelme Egypt gade mpet keladau nnui penuide ngaunggia kebeune.” Cine Kenitme Amalekme dade tetdi. <verse eid="1SA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Cidau Saul Amalekme de ngamdi, Havilah gade gwang Egypt deu naimiak kepetle kebam Shur ga kecang. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Ge pa Amalekme gwangpei Agag de nring tuilu; pa kingtie lepwa kedame pelane de teitset di. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Dede Saul nah pe minadung Agag keringria bangbeu, meurün, hetumseu, hetumna pelui keyibe yitubedung nah meurünnadung. Makeyibe keheibede, penui ngkapdi ma. Dede penui pemi kegahbedung nah kemtabedung rünne ngkapdi.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Cidau RAMPAUBE sam Samuel da gwang, ranggai, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Ih Saul de peu hegwang teikelu a sui meda, pa acai sui mene a dade nreu tet dida nah Ih pecu tei lulo rang kebeudung de tei meda.” Samuel pe ratadi nah tingmui zie pelane RAMPAUBE dage hapgai. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samuel tingcang nuge Saul de redau kera cuhlu. Samuel da rangbeu, “Saul Carmel nam ga gwanglwe cikade pa pekatei pe zi ziemne ngkiengkelu tsusum ge sumgai, nah Gilgal ga tet nghungdi lie.” <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Pecai Samuel Saul da gwanglu, nah Saul pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ne ncu samlam kebeube! Ih RAMPAUBE sam kaikebeu de teicang luda” <verse eid="1SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samuel rangdi, “Ciciu cai Ih a kwen gade meurün mra, nah hetum mrung kwa kesiu de dai no?” <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Saul pe sam keli eh, “Penuine Amalekme dade cidungde keu gwang. Penui meurün nah hetum yitubedung pwa RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de ratak teibeu kerane. Kedabedung de au anui ngkap zingdida.” <verse eid="1SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Cidau Samuel Saul dage rangdi, “Kwalu, nah nzieziu RAMPAUBE dai a dage rang beu bi Ih ncu ranglia zie.” Saul peda rang eh, “Ranggailo!”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samuel rang eh, “Nang nkatei nmiak gade ceu lie de, ncu Israelme leuh hegwangpei tei beu meni? Pecai RAMPAUBE ncu Israelme reu hegwang keniak beu, <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />nah RAMPAUBE ncu n lampui le ge langgai nah rang eh, ‘Mie delwe kemaumedung de ngkap cang siak di, Amalekme de, nah penui ngkapdi kemaktane penuide ngngwa regi lo.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Nang daitei RAMPAUBE sam mzai meno, dede meliene hema tui keludung keu nah RAMPAUBE miak dwa gade kesia tei no?” <verse eid="1SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Cidau Saul Samuel dage rangdi, “Ih RAMPAUBE sam mzai da, nah RAMPAUBE lang kegai lampui ga Ih mie da. Ih Amalekme gwangpei Agag de nimlu da, nah Amalekme pelane de ngkap ciaudi da. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Dede a minadung ma pemi kehungbe niadung keu pwa dida, meurün nah hetumseu, ma yitubedung ngkapdi kerabe, RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de Gilgal gade ratak teigaibeu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Samuel keligai, “RAMPAUBE de keru ratak kepeudung nah reca tei kegaibedung be pesam kemzai swa de pesui yiki zie ni? Samzai au ratak ketei swa yi, nah kingnei kelu au hemeuseu pelui keyibedung swa de yi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mrk. 12:32</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:33">33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Renia kecu au reka mau nzwa, nah riangki kecu au kesia nah heta kesia ketei nzwa. Kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE sam mlai kedine, pa ncude de hegwang tei kera mlai dida.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Cidau Saul Samuel dage rangdi, “Ih mau dida; Ih RAMPAUBE aja kai kebeu de nah n samdung de gi kah dida, kedanemene Ih minadung de hing nah penui sam pung kedine. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Cu, kehereide a mau gibeu lo, nah acu ngngwa cailigwang beu lo ciude Ih RAMPAUBE de reca lu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samuel Saul dage rangdi, “Ih ncu ngngwa caili lak; nang RAMPAUBE sam mlai kedine, nah RAMPAUBE ncu peu Israelme reu hengwang tei kera mlai dida.” <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samuel tet kera nreudi ge, Saul pe cwatie tu kerak, nah tei hakdi. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samuel pe dage rangdi, “Henai RAMPAUBE ndade Israel hegwangram de tei pang dida nah cide n kidame nswa yiki kecu gede peu dida. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Israel kengkieng Tinggwang au nret dilak mede pelung nreudai dilak, pa pe lungnreu kedime ma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:18">Heb. 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Cidau Saul rangdi, “Ih mau dida. Dede kehereide a mina hangkiame nah Israel dwa gade acu cu herüt peulo. Acu ngngwa nreu gwang dai lo, ciude Ih RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de reca lu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Cine Samuel au Saul da nreu gwang dailu, nah Saul RAMPAUBE de recadi.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Cidau Samuel rangdi, “Amalekme gwangpei Agag de aika a da ngngwa gwang lo.” Agag de hegeuriadung le kanglu eh peda gwang nah pekatei pedage rangdi, “Tsaidi kera kekaa de au kahgwang dida nah Ih acu au kaizeu luda.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samuel samkeli eh, “N kingtie ne peu mipuidung de peu pe na gah kedi nzwa, n pui de mipuidung kakga pe na teita di zie.” Cidau Samuel Agag de Gilgal gade RAMPAUBE dwa gade dang kecaidi.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Samuel pe ki Ramah ga miedi, nah Saul peki Gibeah ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Samuel, Saul tsaidi kemaktane pecu ngaudai tadi, pa Saul ziemne pe lungsia kedine. RAMPAUBE Saul depeu Israel reu hegwangpei tei kegaide pe sui tadi.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Samuel ne David de keniak kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />RAMPAUBE Samuel dage rangdi, “Dai tie ge nang Saul ziemne hei eh hap laino, Ih pecu peu Israel reu hegwang tei kera mlai dida? N kii maca le kaipui lu delwe miecu. Ih ncu Bethlehem ga Jesse dage langgai zie, Ih pe namedung kakgade hangge depeu hegwang tei kera kedetlu delu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:31">Luk. 3:31</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:32">32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samuel rangdi, “Dainzwa Ih mie lulai? Magade Saul cide siu cai, pa acu teitset dizie,” RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Nang ketumna ge keulu delwe ranglu, ‘Ih RAMPAUBE dage ratak tei gai kera gwangla.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Jesse de ratak ga qu gailu, nah nang daitei maisiabi Ih saulia zie. Ih rang kelia hangge de nang a ziemne keniaklu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />RAMPAUBE kerang nzwa Samuel teilu nah Bethlehem ga mielu. Namdibe ga hangkiamedung mbeu eh pecu redau kera gwang nah peda keteugai, “Kezuyi gade nang gwang lani?” <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Pa rangdi, “Kezuyi gade; Ih RAMPAUBE dage ratak teigai beulai eh gwangla. Reca ga acu ngngwa gwang kera nnui katei nnuide mteilwe kaintsam pwabam lulo.” Pecai pa Jesse nah pe napeimedung de kedet ntsamlu nah ratak gage penuide qugai.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Jesse nah pe napeidung gwang ge, Samuel, Jesse napei Eliab de piegai nah pekatei pe dage rangdi RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelube pe dwaga sap bam ciang da. <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Dede RAMPAUBE Samuel dage rangdi, “Hegwa zu pie so, mede pe ra kehu de; kedanemene Ih pecu mlai dida. Mina pie kela nzwa RAMPAUBE au pie la kemakne; mina au hegwa zu pie la, dede RAMPAUBE au mi mlung piela.” <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Pecai Jesse Abinadab de qu gai eh Samuel dwaga gwang. Cidau Samuel rangdi, “Aide de liede RAMPAUBE kedet ma.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Jesse peu Shammah de Samuel dwa ga gwang, dede Samuel rangdi, “Aide de liede RAMPAUBE kedet ma.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Jesse pe name hang hena depeu Samuel dwaga gwanglu. Cidau Samuel Jesse dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE penui hangge de de kedet ma.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Cidau Samuel Jesse dage keteudi, “N name aika bamciak deni?” Pa keli eh, “Henatube David cude bamreu, dede pa meurün kwala.” Samuel Jesse dage rang, “Pecu qu gai eh ngngwa gwanglo; pa aika gwang kemaktane anui ntum daulak.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Jesse migede langgai eh David de qugai eh peu ngngwa gwanglu. Pe na aide pe luilung yi nah pe miak de hezuyi nah rehang yi. RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Cuhlu, pecu keniaklu; kedanemene pa delu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Cidau Samuel maca kii de keulu nah pe siname kakgade pecu pecaibe gwangpei tei kera keniaklu. RAMPAUBE rabe cipaunai gade David da kelwa gwanglu. Pecai Samuel cuhlu nah Ramah ga caili miedi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Bat. 13:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">David Saul gwaketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Cu RAMPAUBE Rabe Saul dade tetdi, nah herakesia ge RAMPAUBE dade gwang eh pecu teikeherei di. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Saul gu kedimedung pe dage rangdi, “Ainie, herakesia ge Tinggwang dade gwang ncu teikeherei bam. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Peu anui mpaube de n kilame n dwaga kebamdungde de pecu leibung kwa keci pei ge peei kera aja kai gailo. Pecai herakesia Tinggwang dade kegwang nda kegwangdau, pa leibung kwagai eh nang yilu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Saul pe kilamedung dage rangdi, “A ziemne leibung kwa cisüt kecuge de peeilu nah pecu a da ngngwa gwanglu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Cidau rehangme ge keligai, “Ih Bethlehemme Jesse napei de ngau da, pa leibung kwa cisüt, ngkieng, kekuume ge, reugwame ge, marang kecime ge, hezu keyime ge; nah RAMPAUBE peda la.” <verse eid="1SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Cine Saul samgwamedung Jesse dage langgai, nah rangdi, “N napei David meurün de pierengei kelabe de, a dage langgai lo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Jesse gada ge gage tangku le pe püt teilu, teigeu zaula ge, nah hemeuna ge, nah cidungde pa pe napei David de Saul dage langgai. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Pecai David Saul da gwanglu nah pe gwa teidi. Saul pecu kusüt, nah pa hereunet kepwabe teidi. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Saul, Jesse dage sam langgai, “Peu David de a dwaga sap lo, kedanemene Ih pecu a sui kelune.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Tinggwang dade kegwang herakesia Saul reuga gwang kecudau, David leibung pwalu eh kwagai. Ciu eh Saul mcing nah yi dailu eh, herakesia pe dade tet dila.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">David penai Goliath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Philistinme hereu tei kerane penui reugwame gwang ngkwalu. Penui Judahme deu Sokoh nam ga ngkwalu. Penui Sokoh nam nah Azekah nam kakga, Ephes-Dammim gage ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Saul nah Israelme peidung Elah langkam ga ngkwa nah ramzeuki teilu, nah Philistinme de redau kerane sapbia lu. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Philistinmedung lamlwa ge lam sapbia lu, nah Israelme lamlwa keda ga sap bialu, penui kakga langkam ge bam. <verse eid="1SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Mi ngkieng süt kecu pei ge Philistinme ramzeuki gade pet, Gathme pei ge pe zi Goliath, pe hu cubit herok nah span ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit herok nah span ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Feet hekui kenzwage.</char></note>. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Pe peu ga hetageu peurwa ge bam, nah pecu hegeu ncwa reunet le cum teula. Pe ncwa perüt hetageu shekel cang mengei ge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide au kilogram 57 kenzwa ge</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Pe pi ga hetageu reunet kaipwala nah pa hetageu ngei ge pe hekeutu ga pung la. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Pe ngei tie au disüt, pe ngei paidakme deikim pak siu ge. Pe ngei mui perüt hegeu shekel haiherok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shekel haiherok: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram hena kenzwa ge</char></note> ge. Goliath gu hegeu kepungbe pe dwaga miela. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Pa saplu nah Israelme reugwame leune dage sahgai, “Nnui daitei eh hereu tei kera mpet lano? Ih Philistinme ge meni, nah nnui Saul kilame meni? Nnui katei nnui ziemne hangge de kedetlu nah peu acu regi kera nghung lo. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Magade pa acu ngngwa regi eh acu teitset lucai, anui nnui kila tei zie. Dede Ih pecu ngamlu nah teitset lucai, nnui anui kila tei nah anui gwatei zie.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Philistinme rangdai di, “Ih Israel reugwame de henai heneu kiela. Anui ngngwa regi lu kerane acu mipei ge langgai lo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Saul nah Israelme pelane Philistinme kerang de siu luge, penui lungceu di nah ngngi sütdi.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />David, Jesse napei, pa Ephraim leuhme ge, Judah deu Bethlehem gade gwang. Jesse pe na mipeina hang heset bam. Saul hegwang keteidau Jesse kecingme ge di, minadung kakgade cingsütdi. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Jesse napei kecingme bau hangcum hereu ga Saul cai suimie. Pe name hangcum hereu ga kemiemedung zi Eliab pe neraibe, pe kenabe Abinadab, nah pe kecumbe Shammah. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />David ne henatu. Cingtube hangcum Saul cai suimie. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Ge David Saul gu reugwamaame nah pe pei gu meuründung Bethlehem ga kebam kakga penui pok tei kera mpet nlüt bam. <verse eid="1SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Zie riakdai ge Philistinme gu kengkiengbe pei tingcang nah tinghegi hereu tei kera sap lia bamla.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Cidau Jesse pe napei David da rangdi, “Tak hetakelu ephah ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephah ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram kerei. </char></note> aide nah tangkukwak kerei aidungde n siname da pwamie cu, nah ramzeuki ga n sinamedung dage cidungde keu kelwa miecu. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Nah macakang kerei aidungde reugwame pecang reu kedibe de keu mie beulu. N siname dainzwa bambi pielo nah penui yibam lie kecu keulia kerane mage keu cailigwang lu. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />N siname au Saul de ngngwala nah Israelme peidung pelane Elah langkam ga, Philistinme de keregi bam.” <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />David tingcang nuge cuhlu nah meurün kekwame ge dage pe kauhau mapie kera nlum gaidi. Jesse pecu sam kai kebeu nzwa eh, pa taktyeiniadung punglu nah tetdi. Reugwame hereu ga tetpet lai eh hereukwa sah kebam dau pa ramzeuki ga gwang canglu. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Cidau Israel nah Philistinmedung hereu tei kera sapria lu, reugwame kerai ncwa lu. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />David pegu maniadung hemaa kenzibe dage kainzeudi, reugwame dage pakgai, nah pe sinamedung de kelumgai. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Pa penuide ngngwa resiu bam ge, kengkiengbe pei de, Gath gade Philistinme pei, pe zi Goliath, nah pa Philistinme reugwame kakgade mpet eh, nah ndaa rang bamkela samdung nzwa rang, nah David cidungde siulu. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Israelme pei leune pecu ngau luge, penui pe dade pakdi nah penui hing sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Israelme peidung kakgade rangdi, “Nang aipau pei gwang bam kecube de de ngau mi? Pa Israelme de heneu kie kerane gwang bam. Pecu teitset kelube de de hegwang pei pe maheidung peu zie, nah pe napui de pe nau kera peu zie, nah pe pei kilungme dade Israel ga heraha ha lak.” <verse eid="1SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />David pe taiga kebam reugwame dage rangdi, “Philistinme pei aipaude de teitset kelube ne Israel de hengam gade teumpet kelube daipai ngaulu buino? Philistinme pei hegeurum kemak aide ringla kela Tinggwang reugwame de heneu kielu kera cauno?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Cidau minadung penui rang kebamde pecu ranglia dai, “Pecu teitset kelube de de cidungde tei beuzie.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Pa reugwamedung dage marang kebamde peswa cingtube pei Eliab siu luge. Eliab David de pe rata di, nah pa rangdi, “Daitei nang aika gwang lano? Hetaideu ga kebam meurünnadung kecamna de cau dage gi gai dino? Ih nang ngang kela, nah n mlung ga nggwa kesiade cibam; nang keregi kecu pie kera ziemne aika miela.” <verse eid="1SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />David rangdi, “Ih cu daipai ge teidi deno? Cide ma keteu kegai ge gwale meha?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Pa pe dade nreupwa reugwame kedame lam gwangdi, nah nu nzwa marangdai. Minadung nu de nzwa keligai.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />David rangkedi sam de siu luge, reugwamedung cide nzwa Saul dage paudai beu, nah pa David de qu kera mide langgai. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Cidau David Saul dage rangdi, “Cipau Philistinme de ziemne peu mige mlung de sia diso; n kilabe mie zie nah aipau Philistinme de regi zie.” <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Saul David dage rangdi, “Nang aipau Philistinme de ngngwa regi gailak; nang hena nage reu kecune, nah pa au pe henane gade hereu keteime ge.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:33">Heb. 11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Dede David Saul dage rangdi, “N kilabe au pe pei meurün kwala la. Hingho mede hegum gwang meurünna de kauhau gade tui teudi ge, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />Ih pecai zuimie pecu renia, nah pe mui gade kelilu la. Pa a cu renia cuh ge, Ih pe tangkeimai nzaplu, pecu hui, nah teitset lula. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />N kilabe hingho nah hegum de teitset dida. Aipau hegeurum kemak Philistinme de ci kenzwa hangge zie, pa ringkela Tinggwang reugwamedung de heneu kie kebamne.” <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />David rangdi, “RAMPAUBE acu hingho nah hegum badeu gade kelibeu da. Pa aipau Philistinme ba gade acu kelibeu zie.” Cidau Saul David da rangdi, “Miecu, nah RAMPAUBE depeu ncu ngngwa lalu.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Saul pe reunet David de peu teu. Pa hetageu peurwa de pe peu gage kaibeu, nah pa pecu peu hegeu ncwa teu. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />David Saul kiengtie pe reunet gage kailu. Dede pa tet luma, kedanemene pa cidungde teu nnimla kemakne. Cidau David Saul dage rangdi, “Ih aidungde teu pet regi gailak, Ih aide teu nnimla melu.” Cine David cidungde ra mpet di. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Pa pe tuitie peba gage keulu nah tangtsukang kemduibe mengei reuceuna gade kedetlu; pa cidungde meurün kekwa loko gage kailu. Pa Philistinme tai ga kepetdau pe ba ga pe tangnung la.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Philistinme pei de, pe geu kepungbe de peu pe dwa rai eh David tai nna jüja gwang. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Philistinme pei de pie twagwa gai nah David de ngau, pa pecu hega di, pa hena nage kecune, nah pe luilung yi, hezu de yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Cidau Philistinme pei de David dage rangdi, “Ih heteu ge lie eh, nang tsingtiedung keu eh a da gwang lani?” Nah Philistinme pei de pe rabedung zi teu David de reset di. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Philistinme pei de David dage rangdi, “A da gwang lu, nah Ih ngu ketsai paau tinggim ruinedung nah renaam kaune de peu dizie.” <verse eid="1SA 17:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />David Philistinme pei de sam keli eh, “Nang kingtie ge, hengei ge, nah hengei ge keu eh a da gwang. Dede Ih reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zi teu eh n da gwang la, Israel reugwame Tinggwang, nang mlai kebambe de. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Henai RAMPAUBE acu n reu ngkiengkelu peuzie, nah Ih ncu teitset dizie nah n peu n pum gade teutsam dizie. Henai Ih Philistinme reugwame tsaipaaudung pwa tinggim ruinedung nah kideu ga renaam kaunedung de peu dizie, ciciu lu eh kideu pelane Israel ga Tinggwang kebam ci luzie, <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />nah aika ngkwa kebam peciakne RAMPAUBE kingtie mede hengei le kengkieng peula melie kecu cilu zie. Hereu au RAMPAUBE gu kecune, nah pa ncu anui ba gage kaibeu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 17:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Philistinme pei de cuhlu nah David da gwang kecu dau, David pecu redau kera ngaurau reugwame lam pak mzet süt pet.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:3">Lei. 27:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />David pe loko gage pe ba kai, tangtsu ge cikade keulu, keling gai, nah Philistinme pei sipie gage samdi. Tangtsu Philistinme pei sipie ga nlüt di, nah pa kau mie hangdeu ga pe zu ngkum bam di.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />David Philistinme pei de tangnung ge nah tangtsu ge le ngamlu. Pa Philistinme pei de samdi nah teitset di. David ba ga kingtie gede bam ma. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Pecai David pakpet Philistinme pei de reu ga saplu nah pe kingtie keulu, kinghya gade jütlwe, pecu teitset di, nah cide le pe peu dang di. Philistinmedung penui kengkieng bede tsaidi kecu ngau kegai dau, penui pak di. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Cidau Israel mepeidung nah Judahme sahbak eh cuhlu, nah Philistinme de Ekron kiriedung nah langkamdung kecang gwamie di. Philistinme ketsaipaau Shaaraim kemie lampui ga, Gath nah Ekron namdidung ga kecang mla zeudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:36">Jos. 15:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Israelme Philistinme de zui mie kecu gade cailigwang lu, nah penui ramzeuki gade penui gunia pwalu. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />David Philistinme pei de peu pwalu nah cide Jerusalem ga pwa gwang, dede pa pe reunetdung pe paiki gage kai zeudi.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Saul David Philistinme pei de renia kera tet petla kecu ngau ge, pa reugwame reu kedibe Abner da rangdi, “Abner, aipau rehangpei de cau napei no?” Abner rangdi, “Nang ring kela nzwa, hegwangpei, Ih ci ma.” <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Hegwangpei rangdi, “Cau napei bi, cilu kebuime dade keteu lo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />David Philistinme pei Goliath de teitset lwe cailigwang luge, Abner pecu ngngwalu, nah Philistinme pei de peu pe ba gage pwa lwe Saul dwa ga ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Saul pe dage rangdi, “Rehangbo, nang cau napei no?” David keligai, “Ih Bethlehemme n kilabe Jesse napei lie.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Saul David de periak kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Pa Saul dage ma rangcang dige, Jonathan keringria David keringria da ncütdi, nah Jonathan pecu kupwa pe keringria de keku nzwadi. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Cipaunai Saul David de ngngwa pegwa teidi; pa pecu peu pe pei ki ga cailigwang tadi. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Cidau Jonathan nah David zangna tei kera sampet teilu kedanemene Jonathan pecu kupwa pekatei pe keringria de keku nzwa kedine. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Jonathan pe nia pa teu kelade gau mpetlwe David de peu, pe reunet, kingtie, lakpi nah kiakang de si eh. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />David Saul pecu lang kegai leu ga mie, nah pa ngkieng lu. Saul pecu hereu keteime reu gage kaibeu. Aide mina pelane miakdwade suiyi teilu nah Saul kilame dwade de.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Penui Philistinme de ngam lwe gwang keladau, Israel namdi leune gade mipuidung leitei nah helim lim eh hegwangpei Saul de dau kera gwang, tambourinedung kwa eh, penui suiyi eh nah leibungdung kwa eh. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Mipuidung nggwa eh hangge ge dage leitei gai. Penui leitei gai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">“Saul mina cang cang teitset lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">nah David mina cang kereirei teitset lu.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Saul pe rata sütdi, nah lei aide pe suisiet tei di. Pa rangdi, “Penui David de cang kereidung de rang bam, dede acube cang rünsangne. Pa dai ge teumai siareu ah hegwang ketei de si mene?” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Saul cipaunai gade David de mning msia eh piedi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Pecai benai hera kesia Tinggwang dade zette Saul da gwang di nah pa kilung ga kemieme ge nzwa sah bakbak bam di. Cine David pe leibung kwa gai, pa langnai ramsangne tei kebam nzwa. Saul pe ba ga hengei ge bam. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Saul hengei de hiagai, “David de tangdeu gage hiagim dizie” de pa cet. Dede ainzwa eh David, Saul dwade pia na paklu. <verse eid="1SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Saul au David de hing di, kedanemene RAMPAUBE au peda la, dede Saul de ngngwa lasi tadi. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Cine Saul pe dwa de pecu keu mpetdi nah peu mina cang reu muibe tei kera kedetlu. Ainzwa eh David hereu teikera tetpet nah ngkiengkelu teu eh pe minadung da cailigwanglu. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />David pe lampui leune ga yilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE peda kelane. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Saul David yi kedi ngau luge, pa pe ma cangh sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Dede Israelme nah Judahme pelane David de hungdi, kedanemene pa hereu teikera pet ge ngkiengkelu teu eh pe minadung da cailigwang kelune.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Cidau Saul David dage rangdi, “Aika a napui cingtube Merab bam. Nnau kera Ih ncu peu zie. A ziemne kuulu nah RAMPAUBE hereudung regilu.” Kedanemene Saul cet kecu, “Peu a ba lepwa pe reu gage kai diso, dede Philistinme ba de peu pe reu gage kailu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />David Saul dage rangdi, “Ih cau no, nah a kibaumedung cau no, mede Israel ga a pei pautsa, peu acu hegwangpei napui nahpei lu kera?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Dede Saul napui Merab de, David de peu kerating di ge, pecu Meholahme Adriel nau kera peu di. <verse eid="1SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Dede Michal, Saul napui henabe, David de mrai di. Penui Saul dage ranggai nah aide pa pe suilu. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Cidau Saul cet di, “Ih Michal de pecu peu zie, ciude pa baih ge luzie pe ziemne, nah iciu lude Philistinme ba pe reu gage kailu kerane.” Cine Saul David dage pe kenabe rang, “Nang a napui nahpei zie.”<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Saul pe kilamedung dage aja kaigai, “David de ngkim eh resiu lu, nah aiciu eh ranglu, ‘Ainie, hegwangpei ncu pesui yibam, nah pe kilamedung pelane ncu hung lie. Cine cu, hegwangpei napui nahpei tei di lulo.’” <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Cine Saul kilamedung sam aidungde David dage ranggai. Cidau David rangdi, “Hegwangpei napui nahpei tei kera makeceuna ge ni nnui ziemne, Ih au makegahme ge kecune, nah mi ne mning hena kelame?” <verse eid="1SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Saul kilamedung David kerang samdung Saul dage paulia. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Cidau Saul rangdi, “David dage aide ranglo, ‘Hegwangpei au hemeupui mi magede luuneu ma Philistinmedung haige gu geutün gwale, hegwangpei ngauraume dade hekumpeeilu kerane.’” Cu Saul David de Philistinmedung ba gade peu kaudi kera cetdi. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Pe kilamedung David dage sam aidung ranglia ge, David hegwangpei tsapei kera pe sui yidi. <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Tingba cidungde cangdi kemakdwa, David pe minadung de ngngwa mie nah Philistinme haina de gilu. David penui geutün keugwang, nah penui ci pelane hegwangpei de peudi, iciu eh pa hegwangpei napui nahpei lu kerane. Cine Saul pe napui Michal de pe nau kera peudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />RAMPAUBE David da kela ngau nah cilu ge, nah Michal Saul napui David de pe sui kedi ci dige,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelme pelane de David de penui suidi.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Saul David de hing gwa di. Saul au David de ngaurau jüja di.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Pecai Philistinme hegwangdung hereu tei kera tetpet, nah penui tet kemie ramsang, David Saul gu kedimedung pelane swade ngkieng kiee lu, cine pe zi disüt di.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Saul David de teitset kera ketelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Saul pe napei Jonathan nah pe kilame pelane dage David de teitset dilo eh rangdi. Dede Saul napei, Jonathan David de pe sui yisütla. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Cine Jonathan David de rangbeu, “Saul a pei ncu teitset di kera peeila. Cine tingcang mriak bamlu nah heni kengkim ge ga ncu kebailu. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Ih nang mbai kebam ni ga a pei taiga sap lwe Ih pe dage n ha ranglia beuzie. Ih magede ci lucai, Ih ncu ranglia zie.” <verse eid="1SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Jonathan pe pei Saul dage David ha rang hemi nah pa rangdi, “Peu hegwangpei de pe kilabe David dage kemau teigai helo. Kedanemene pa n dage kemau gede teigai melu, nah pe ta teikegai leune au ncu nghasüt kegai ge. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Pa pe pum kaibeu nah Philistinme de teitsetlu. RAMPAUBE Israel de ngkiengkelu kedige peu. Nang cide ngaulu ge n sui yilu da. Nang daitei kemau kegah ge dage kemau teigai neula no, pekie gahzing kecu gade David de teitset gai kera?” <verse eid="1SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Jonathan kerangde Saul kingnei lu. Saul sampet gai, “RAMPAUBE ringkela nzwa, pecu teitsetdi lak.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Cidau Jonathan David de qu gai, nah Jonathan aidung de pelane pecu ranglia. Jonathan David de Saul da ngngwa gwang lu, nah pa ndaa nzwa pedwa ga bamlu.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Hereu ge teidai, nah David tet pet Philistinmedung de regi nah mina kekiee gede gidi eh penui ngkieng lu. Nah penui pe dwa de pak di. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Saul pe ki ga pe ngei pe ba ga pwa lwe kebam dau herakesiabe ge RAMPAUBE dade Saul reuga gwang, nah David pe leibung kwa bam. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Saul pe ngei pwa David de tangdeu gage hiagim di kera teicu, dede pa Saul dwa gade mliak di, iciu eh Saul hengei de tangdeu gage hiadi. David cipau ziu pak mbai tetdi. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Saul midung gede David ki kwa lwe pecai benai tingcang teitsetdi kerane langgai. Michal, David nau, pecu rangbeu, “Nang heziu n teilung keli lumai, ncünne ncu teitsetdi zie da.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Cine Michal peu David de hebaki ge gade nghung lu, nah pa pakmie mbaidi. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Michal kilungme reca kela mamie ge pwa zeulie gage kailu, pecai pa pe peu gage hemeu mai le tei kelu biangkum ge kailu, nah cide paidung le teu hadi. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Saul David de ngngwa kerane samgwame lang kegaidau, pa rangdi, “Pa au teeinei bam.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Cidau Saul David de pie kera samgwame de langgai; pa rang eh, “Pe zeu gade pecu aika pwa gwanglu, iciu de Ih pecu teitset dizie.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Samgwamedung de lwetlu ge, ainie, kilungme reca kela mamie de nah hemeu mai le tei kelu biangkum de zeu ga cipau peu ga kebam ngau lu. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Saul Michal dage rangdi, “Nang daitei acu kedak nah a ngauraube de peu paktet di no?” Michal Saul sam keligai, “Pa a dage rangdi, ‘Acu peu tetlo. Ih ncu daitei teitset laino?’”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Cu David pak pwa Ramah nam ga Samuel da gwang di nah Saul pe dage tei kegai leune paubeu. Ge Samuel nah pa Naioth qu kela ni ga mie bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Saul dage aide paubeu, “Pielo, David au Ramah nam ga Naioth qu kela ni ga bam.” <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Cidau Saul samgwame de David de tuikera langgai. Penui caihakecime maage cairasam rang kebam ngau ge, nah Samuel penui reu muiteu ge tei sap kebam, Tinggwang Rabe Saul samgwame reu gwangdi, nah penui de cairasam rangdi. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Saul de aide ranglia beuge, pa samgwame kedamedung de langgai, nah penui de cairasam rangdi. Cine Saul samgwame pe kecumbe langgai dai, nah penui de cairasam rangdi. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Pecai pa de Ramah ga mie nah Seku nam ga tekwa kecok dega gwanglu. “Samuel nah David daiga lano?” Pa keteu. Mige rang eh, “Pielo, penai Ramah ga Naioth ga bam.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Saul Naioth, Ramah ga mie. Pecai Tinggwang Rabe pe reu ga gwangdi, nah pa mie la ge Naioth ga Ramah ga gwang lu kemak ta cairasam rangdi. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Pa pe paini ra di nah Samuel dwaga de cairasam rangdi. Pa cipau nai nah cipau ziu de pelane paaula eh bamdi. Aide ziemne penui keteu di, “Saul de caihakecime kakga bamni?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">David penai Jonathan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Pecai David Ramah ga Naioth gade pakpwa Jonathan da gwang nah Jonathan dage rangdi, “Ih daipai teidi di no? Ih teimau kedi de dai no? N pei dwaga a mau dai no, pa acu teitset zielie kera?” <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Jonathan David dage keligai, “Nang cikade ndei dilu, nang tsaidi lak. A pei a dage rang mene kedige mede keceu nage de tei lama. Daitei a pei aidungde a dade mbai lai? Cide kesang ma.” <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Dede David sampet dai nah rangdi, “Daikenzwa ge n miak dwa gade nang acu n sui bi n pei ci hemi sütbam. Pa rangdi, ‘Jonathan de peu aide ci so, mecai pa pelung keherei sütdi zielu.’ Dede RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, nah nang ring kela nzwa, cika au dede pikiet ge bam ketsai anai kakga.” <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Cidau Jonathan David dage keligai, “Nang kerang keheileu, Ih teibeu zie.” <verse eid="1SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />David Jonathan dage rangdi, “Ncünne au hekei keheci, nah Ih hegwangpei de ngngwa bam eh matyei maisia. Dede peu acu tet lo, iciu eh Ih luh ga lang pekecum benai tinghegi kecang akatei acu mbai nzeu lu kerane. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />N pei Ih bam kemak ngaulu cai, ainzwa ranglu, ‘David pe namdi Bethlehem gage pakgai lu kera a dade kiebi di; kedanemene cide mmi ramsangkum reca teibam kela pautsa pelane ziemne kecune.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Pa, ‘Petau da’ de rang cai, n kilabe da kezuyi bam luzie. Dede pa pe rata sütdi cai, pa acu tei keherei gai kera riempwa kebam nang cilu zie. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ciziemne n kilabe ma pie teune lulo. Kedanemene nang n kila bede RAMPAUBE kemci samkak kelu de nda teugwang lu delu. Dede Ih mau liecai, nang acu teitset di lulo; Daitei eh acu n pei da ngngwa gwang lai no?” <verse eid="1SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Jonathan rangdi, “Cikenzwa be au mning di helo! A pei ncu tei keherei gai kera cetpwa kebam cicai ge, Ih n dage rangbeu lak luini?” <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Cidau David Jonathan dage rangdi, “N pei pe rata eh ncu sam kelikegai cai caune a dage cide paubeu zieno?” <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Jonathan David dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, anai luh ga mie go.” Cine penai hangnana luh ga mie di.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Jonathan David dage rangdi, “Peu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang de, zierang teilu. Ih ncünne a pei de aikenzwa tingdau keteu kegai dau, mede lang pekecum benai, ainie, David da makeyi ge bam liecai, Ih n dage langgai eh peu ncu cide lak ni? <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Magade a pei ncu tei rejam neu lacai, peu RAMPAUBE de Jonathan dage tei gailu, nah cipau reude magade peu ncu cilak liecai peu ncu langgai dilu, ciude nda kezuyi bam luzie. Magade a pei ncu tei rejam neu lacai, peu RAMPAUBE de Jonathan de tei rejam dilu nah ciswa de tei kiee kigailu magade ncu peu cide cigai meliecai nah ncu kezuyi gade langgai di meliecai. Peu RAMPAUBE de ncu ngngwa lalu, a pei de ngngwala kecu nzwa. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ih cude ringbam cai, nang acu RAMPAUBE gu samkakkelu masang de acu keulia lak ni, iciu eh Ih tsaidi melu kerane? <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />N samkakkelu masang de a kilungme dage kelunghta peu bam lo, kideube zu gade RAMPAUBE David de ngau keraume leune de ngkap di lie de.” <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Cine Jonathan David kilungme dage sampet gai nah pa rangdi, “Peu RAMPAUBE de David ngauraume de saja peulo.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Jonathan David de peu sampet gaidai kedanemene pe keku David da kebam ziemne, kedanemene Jonathan pekatei pecu kehung nzwa eh David de hungla kedine. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Cidau Jonathan pe dage rangdi, “Ncünne au hekei keheci ngyi da. Apei nang bam kemak ngau luzie, kedanemene n bam mta di zielu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Nang langcumne bamlu sangne, zette nghung nang ndaa kembai bam ga, nah Ezel lie eh qu kela tsukwa ga bamlu. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Ih cika ge lakpitsi kecum kapgai zie, Ih cide de kah lwe kap kebam nzwa. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Ih rehangpei gede langgai zie nah peda rangbeu zie, ‘Mie lakpitsidung de peeilu’. Magade Ih rehangpei da rang eh, ‘Pielo, lakpitsidung ntaiga cika bam; cidungde keulu,’ decai cidau gwanglu; kedanemene madedu meda nziemne, RAMPAUBE ringkela gade. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Dede magade Ih rehangpei dage rang eh, ‘Pielo, Lakpitsidung keda lambie bam’, degai cai nang tetdilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne ncu lang gidi zeu delu. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Anai hangge ge sampet kegai de, ainie, RAMPAUBE ne anai kakga lamui zie.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Cine David luh ga mbai bamdi. Hekei keheci gwang ge, hegwangpei matyei kera ntum bamlu. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Hegwangpei pe bam ga, bam kela nzwa tangdeu taiga bamlu. Jonathan pecu kencwa ga bamlu, nah Abner Saul taiga bamlu. Dede David bam de mta di. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Dede Saul cipaunai magede rang ma, kedanemene pa, “Pe dage mage teigai dida, nah pa mci meda; pa mci mezing da,” de cet kedine. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Dede lang pekena benai, hekei keheci cai benai de, David bam mtadi. Saul pe napei Jonathan dage rang, “Daitei eh Jesse napei nziene mede henai de matyei kecu ga gwang meno?” <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Jonathan Saul de keligai, “David Bethlehem ga mie kera a dade penggia kiedi. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Pa rangdi, ‘Kehereide acu peu mielo. Kedanemene anui kibaume namdi gade ratakngyi ge bamlau lu, nah a siname acu cika gwanglo di. Cu, magade nang acu nsui liecai, kehereide peu a siname da mielo.’ Aide ziemne pa hegwangpei bam ga gwang meda,”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Cidau Saul Jonathan de perata sütdi, nah pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang hekakna, kehebwak pui napei ge! Nang Jesse napei de nkatei n ngngam nah n pui ngngam ziemne kedet kelude de Ih cimene bamni? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Jesse napei kideu ga lungh kebamtane, nang renam aide reu hegwang tei gailak. Cine pecu mie ngngwa lwe ada gwanglu, pa tsai bi maisia” <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Jonathan pe pei Saul sam keligai, “Daipai kie gade pecu peu tsai lai no? Pa daitei di no?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Cidau Saul pecu teitset di kerane pe ngei hiagai. Cine Jonathan pe pei David de teitset di kera mning teula kedi cilu. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Jonathan pe rata eh taktyeibam gade cuhlu, nah pa hekei keheci langnane benai magede tyei ma, pa David ha cetpwa pe lung keherei sütdi, kedanemene pe pei David de herüt peulu ta kedine.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Pecai benai tingcang Jonathan David de redau kerane luh ga mie, nah pa rehang nage de ngngwa mie. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Pa rehangna ge dage rang, “Pakmie Ih lakpitsi kap kegaide peei teugwang lu.” Rehangna de pakmiedi ge, pa lakpitsi ge peswa gage kapgai. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Henana be lakpitsi Jonathan ne kap kegai de cakmie kedi ga gwangcang luge, Jonathan henana de qu eh rangdi, “Lakpitsi nswa ga bam meni?” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Pecai Jonathan henanabe de qugai, “Kelwa lu, cika sap so!” Cine henana be lakpitsi keu hekwalwe pe mpaube Jonathan da cailigwang. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Dede henana be pekie daibi kecu magede cima. Jonathan penai David rünne cibam. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Jonathan pe reunetdung henana bepei de peudi nah pe dage rangdi, “Miecu, delwe cidun de Gibeah namdibe ga teugwang culo.” <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Henana bede tet kedicai, David tsubau cai gade cuhlwe kwaktunglu delwe pe zu ngkum lwe hangdeu ga piacum keumie. Penai hangge gede kemam nah penai ngngwa hap bamdi, David be hap nteiki. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Jonathan David dage rangdi, “Lungciep peu nda lalu, kedanemene anai RAMPAUBE zi gade sampetlu delu nah rangdi, ‘Peu RAMPAUBE de anai kakga bamlu, a leuhme nah n leuhme kakga, kelunghta.’” Pecai David cuhlu nah tetdi, nah Jonathan namdibe ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">David Nob ga kebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Pecai David Nob namceu ga cingkupei Ahimelech de pie kera gwang. Ahimelech David de mbeu eh redau nah peda rangdi, “Nang daitei nkatei rünne nah migede si mene gwang lano?” <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />David cingkupei Ahimelech dage rangdi, “Hegwangpei ne acu bata tei kerane langgai lie, nah pa a dage ranggai, ‘Ih ncu lang kegaide migede de peu ci helo, nah Ih aja kai kebeude.’ Ih penuide heni ge gade acu redau lulo beu dida. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Cu ciucai n ba ga dai ge bam no? Acu tangku kwak mengei peu lo, mede keheibe aika kebam be.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Cingkupei, David de keligai nah rangdi, “Tangku kedabe a ba ga bam meda, dede cika kemci tangku bam, magade nang nah n minadung nnui katei de mipuidung dade kai ntsam pwabam cai.” <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />David, cingkupei de keligai, “ Langcumne ge mipuidung de anui dade keu ntsam pwabam kesang, anui tetpet kecudau tei bammui kelade nzwa. Nlang ham kemak bata ketei dau de a mina niadung keu ntsam pwa bamla. Daikenzwa ge henai au mide tei mci pwabam maisia zie bi!” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Cine kai ntsam pwa kebam tangku de cingkupei pecu peudi. Kedanemene cika tangku keda gahdi, pebam cikage tangku keumpet kedi benai peu kelumbe tangku kailu kerane, RAMPAUBE dwa gade keumpet pwa kebam Kaikenzeu Tangku rünne gwale.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Cu Saul kilame hangge cipaunai cika bam, RAMPAUBE dwaga bam. Pe zi Doeg, pa Edomme, Saul gu tumkwa ditube. <verse eid="1SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />David Ahimelech dage rangdi, “Nda hengei ge mede kingtie gede bam mi? Ih kingtie mede hereunia gede keu gwang meda, kedanemene hegwangpei ta de tei zette maisia kedine.” <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Cingkupei rangdi, “Nang Elah langkam gade teitset kegaibe, Philistinme Goliath kingtie, hekeutupai caiga dumgai pwabam. Nang cide luu neucai keulu, kedanemene hereunet cide rünne aika bam.” David rangdi, “Cide kenzwa kingtie keda gah da; acu cide peulo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David Gath ga kebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />David cipau nai cuhlu delwe Saul dade pakdi nah Gath namdi ga, hegwangpei Achish taiga miedi. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Hegwangpei Achish kilame pe dage rang eh, “Aide David meni, aipau deu ga hegwangpei? Israelme puidung pe ha ziemne hangge ge dage leitei eh helim lim meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 21:11">‘Saul mina cang cang teitset lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 21:11">nah David mina cang kereirei teitset lu?’”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />David aipau samdung de pe mlung gage kailu nah pa Gath ga hegwangpei Achish de hing sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Pa pe zaireli penui taiga de tei ntsam di nah pa cangta kedi ciem tei bamdi; pa kirie kikamdung gage marau nah peu pe ntam pe tangkeimai ga zaumie bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Pecai Achish pe kilamedung dade rangdi, “Ainie, mina be au miee dida. Daitei eh nnui pecu ada ngngwa gwang lano? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Ada kemieeme gah ni, aipaude de kemieme ge nzwa a dwaga ngngwa gwang kera? Aikenzwa gede peu a hegwangki ga lüt zieni?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">David Adullam nah Mizpah ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Cine David cika de pak pwa Adullam namdi gage pakgai di. Pe siname nah pe kibaume David daiga mie dibi kecu siuluge, penui pe taiga miedi. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Pelane penuide teikeherei kecume mede mipau pung kedime mede penui suisia kedime peda gwang ngkwalu. David penui reu muiteu teilu. Pe taiga mina hai mdai kenzwa gede nzangla.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Pecai David cika de Moab deu ga Mizpah nam ga miedi. Pa Moab hegwangpei dage rang eh, “Kehereide peu apei penai apui de ngngwa mpet beulo, Ih Tinggwang a ziemne daipai teigai lai eh bambi de cilu kemaktane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">keherei de peu a pei penai a mipui de nda bam lo, </char> de eh bam nah kesa keheci laisiudung ga de aide bamla. </note> <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Pa penaide Moab ga hegwangpei dage püt gaidi. Cine pe pei penai pe pui peda bamdi, peting pelane David cika bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Pecai caihakecibe Gad David dade rangdi, “Aika bam so, cika pütdi delwe Judah deuga mie cu.” Cine David tetdi delwe Hereth gung ga miedi.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul ne Nob cingkume de teitset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Mige ne Saul dage David nah pecu ngngwa kela minadung de ngaulu delie pau beu. Cidau Saul Gibeah ga bam. Ramah ga tamarisk bang ge kang ga ntum bam, pe ba ga pengei bam, nah pe kilamedung pecu sap twagwa pung bam. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Saul pe kilame pecu sap twagwa kebamdung dage rangdi, “Cu kingneilu, Benjamin leuhmedung! Jesse napei nnui pelane de luh nah kubeluhdung peuciau zie ni? Nnui pelane de cangcang reu nah haihai reu kedi tei kera peu zieni, <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />acu kemmau ciem riem kebeu ne? Nnui migede a na Jesse napei de ngngwa samkak kela sam de acu rangma. Nnui migede aziemne nnui lungnei ma. Nnui migede a dage a kilabe dage David a minadung pecu tei ngkuu beu kera ha rangma. Henai David mbaih eh acu kwabam iciude pa acu gwa ketang kerane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ngauraube teidi kerane</char></note>.” <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Pecai Doeg Edomme, Saul kilamedung taiga kebambe samkeligai, “Ih Jesse napei Nob ga Ahitub napei Ahimelech da gwang eh pecu ngauda. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimelech RAMPAUBE dade kekie teigai David de nghabeu kerane, nah pa pecu taktyei kesa nah Philistinme pei Goliath kingtie pwapeu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Pecai hegwangpei Saul cingkupei Ahimelech Ahitub napei nah pe kibaume Nob ga cingku tei kebam peciakne de qu kera mige de langgai. Penui pelane hegwangpei da gwanglu. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Saul rangdi, “Cu kingnei lu, Ahitub napei.” Pa samkeligai “Ih aika bam, a mpaubo.” <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Saul pe dage rangdi, “Daitei eh nang acu nah Jesse napei de mmau eh heciem pei lano, cinzwa eh nang pecu tangku nah kingtie ge peu, nah Tinggwang dage nghalo kie, pa pecu nghalu kerane, ciude, pa cuhlwe acu renia lu kerane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ngauraube teidi kerane</char></note> pa henai tei kebam nzwa kengkim ga mbailu kerane ni?” <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Pecai Ahimelech hegwangpei de keligai nah rangdi, “N kilame peciakne kakgade cau David nzwa samsang bamno, hegwangpei napui nahpei, n pumkwame reu kedibe da nah n ki ga mina leune pecu rütsüt lie. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Henai ne raitube tei eh pecu ngha beulo Ih Tinggwang dade kieni? Ada de ndei dilu! Peu hegwangpei de pe kilabe mede a pei ki ga kebam peciakne dede peu nmau diso. Kedanemene n kilame magede cigai laklu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Dede hegwangpei sam keligai, “Ahimelech, nang nah n kibaume pelane tsai bizie.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Hegwangpei pe taiga kwa kebamme dage rangdi, “Nreugwang RAMPAUBE cingkupeidung de teitsetdi. Kedanemene penui de David lam sap kela ne, nah penui pa pakdi kecu cibam, dede magede a dage paubeu ma.” Dede hegwangpei kilamedung RAMPAUBE cingkupeidung de teitset kera heba ge de hwagai luta di. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Cine hegwangpei Doeg dage rangdi, “Nreugwang cingkumedung de teitsetdi.” Cine Doeg Edomme nreugwang cingkumedung de teitsetdi, pa mina riakheset eh mengei de, langcimpai hekeutupai teubah kebamme de cipau nai teitsetdi. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Pa Nob namdi ga lungh kela pelane cingkumedung, mipei nah mipui, hename nah ngienadung, nah hetumseu nah gada, nah meuründung penui pelane de teitsetdi.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Dede, Abiathar, Ahimelech napei Ahitub napei hangge paklu, nah David cai miedi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiathar David dage Saul RAMPAUBE cingkupeidung de teitsetdi kecu rangbeu. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />David Abiathar dage rangdi, “Ih cipaunai Edommepei Doeg de cikade kengau dau pa Saul dage paubeu bi kera Ih cida. Ih n kibaume tsit pelane de a zie da! <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Acu ngngwa bamlu, nah ngngi diso. Kedanemene mi ncu teitsetdi zielie pei kela de acu de pei kela da. Nang acu ngngwa bamlu, kwaklu zie.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">David ne Keilah nam de keli kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Midung ge David dage rangdi, “Pielo, Philistinmedung au Keilah namdi de nggwa regi bam dida nah hecaipung de sütbam dida.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Cine David RAMPAUBE dage ngha lo eh kekie teigai nah pecu keteudi, “Ih mie Philistinme de gwaketang zie ni?” RAMPAUBE David da rang eh, “Mie Philistinme de gwa ketang eh Keilah de kelilu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />David minadung pe dage rangdi, “Ainie, anui au Judah aika ngngi bam. Anui Keilah ga mie Philistinme reugwame de ketang cai daikenzwa ge si zie no?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Cidau David RAMPAUBE dage ngha lo eh kie gai dai. RAMPAUBE pe samkeligai, “Cuhlu, Keilah ga hungcu. Ih ncu Philistinme reu kengkieng peu zie lu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />David nah pe minadung Keilah ga mie Philistinme de ngngwa regi. Pa penui tum gwa tetdi nah penuide gi sütdi. Cine David Keilah ga kelungme de kelilu. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Ahimelech napei Abiathar Keilah ga David dage pakgai kedi dau, pa hekeutupai ge peba ga keulwe nghung.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saul David de zuikemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />David Keilah ga gwang di delie Saul dage rangbeu. Saul rang eh, “Tinggwang aba gage pecu peu dida. Kedanemene namdi ge heriekidung nah renamrie pwa kebam ga pa lütlwe pe katei pecu ngkuinam kedine.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Saul hereu tei kerane pe reugwame pelane de Keilah ga nghung lulo qugai, David nah pe minadung de tuilu kerane. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />David Saul pecu teikeherei gai kera riem pwa bamlie kecu cilu ge, pa cingkupei Abiathar dage rang eh, “Hekeutupai de aika keu gwanglu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Cidau David rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Saul Keilah ga gwang kesang kerade n kilabe siu luda, a ziemne namdibe ngkapdi kera. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Keilah ga minadung pe ba gage acu kaibeu dizie ni? N kilabe siukelu nzwa, Saul nghung zie ni? RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Ih n dade kie la, N kilabe dage nggia eh rangbeu lo.” RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Pa nghung luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Cidau David rangdi, “Keilah ga minadung dage a minadung nah acu Saul dage kaibeu dizie ni?” RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Penui dage ncu kaibeu dizie.” <verse eid="1SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Cidau David nah pe minadung, hai herok kenzwa ge, cuhlu delwe Keilah gade tetdi, nah penui heni ge gade heni gega mie. Saul dage David Keilah gade pakdi delie rangbeu, nah pa pecai gwakela de mtakdi. <verse eid="1SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />David hetaideu ga kemsiubamdung ga bamdi, Ziph hetaideu, lamlwatu deudi ga. Saul langnai ramsang pecu peei, dede Tinggwang pecu pe ba gage kaibeu dima.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />David Saul pe keringria keu di kera peei gwang kela ngaulu; cidau David Ziph hetaideu Horesh ga bam. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Cidau Jonathan, Saul napei, cuhlwe Horesh ga David da mie, nah Tinggwang dade kengkieng ngaulu. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Pa pe dage rangdi, “Ngngi diso. Saul a pei ncu peei gai lakta. Nang Israelme reu hegwang tei luzie, nah Ih n cai zie. A pei Saul de aide cibam.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Penui RAMPAUBE dwa gade samkaklu. David Horesh ga bamdi, nah Jonathan kilung gwang di.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Pecai Ziph gade midungge Gibeah ga Saul da gwang eh rangdi, “David Horesh kemsiubamdung ga anui kakga mbai bam meni, Hakilah deutu ga, Jeshimon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeshimon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heni aide Ketsai Jaaidi mbie ga mina lungh takedi deu naimiak kepetle Judea deudi lebie kebam deu deda. </char></note> tingpile? <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />N keneu nzwa nghung lu, hegwangpei! N keneu nzwa, nghung lu! Anui nsam au pecu hegwang ba gage kai beu kera deda.” <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Saul rangdi, “RAMPAUBE de peu ncu samlam beulo. Nang acu ngaunggia kegai ziemne. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Mie, delwe ci mcilu. Pa daiga mbai bam bi kecu nah cau cika pecu ngaubi kecu ci lulo. Ada ge rang kebeu au pa mriaksüt lie zeu. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Cine pielo, nah pa pekatei mbai kebam henidung pelane cilu. Delwe nang ci mci gilu de cailigwanglu, iciude Ih ncu ngngwalwe mie zie. Magade pa cipau deu ga bam cai, Ih pecu Judahme pecang kebam kakgade peei mpet luzie.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Cidau penui cuhlu delwe Ziph ga Saul dwarai miedi. Cidau David nah pe minadung Maon renaamkang ga bam, Jeshimon tingpile Arabah ga. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Saul nah pe minadung pecu peei mie. Dede cide David dage rangbeu, cine pa tsura deutu Maon hetaideu ga mie lunghdi. Saul cide siulu ge, pa David de Maon hetaideu ga zuimie. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Saul lamlwatu tuge lambie ladi, nah David nah pe minadung lamlwa keda lebie tet ladi. David Saul dade kelwa eh pak ladi. David nah pe minadungde Saul nah pe minadung ne twagwalu penuide tui kera, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Samgwame ge Saul da gwang eh rangdi, “Kelwa eh gwanglu, Philistinmedung hangdeube ga gwalwet ladi kecune.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Cine Saul David de zui si tadi nah Philistinme de renia kera cailigwang di. Ciziemne heni cide de Pakkelu Tsura Deutu lie qula. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />David cika de nghang di nah Engedi kemsiubamdung ga lungh di.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">David Saul de mbaikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Saul Philistinme de gwa kela gade cailigwanglu ge, David Engedi renaamkang ga bam lie peda rangbeu. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Cidau Saul Israelme pelane kakgade reugwa yitume cangcum de ngngwa lwe David nah pe minadung de Helung bam Tsura ga peeimie. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Pa meuründung bam lampui taiga cika tsupop ge ga gwanglu. Saul cika mtak kera nlütlu. Cu David nah pe minadung tsupop lungki kecuk lebie mbai bam. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />David pe minadung pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE n dage rang kebeu tingba zie aide delie, ‘Ih ngauraume de n ba gage kaibeu zielie n dage rang kebeu nzwa, nang pe dage n suibe teigai lu kerane.’” Pecai David cuhlu nah zing de liahang Saul cwatie tuge dang mpetlu. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Pecai David ne Saul cwatie tu dang kedine pa pelung cang tadi. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Pa pe minadung dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE de peu Ih a mpaube de teikeherei di kera gade acu kezeu beulo, RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelube, pecu a ba hetwa pet rezam dilu kebui gade, kedanemene, ngau kegai pecu au RAMPAUBE ne keniaklu dilu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Cine David pe minadungde sam aidungde le kesiugai, nah penuide peu Saul de gwaketang kera peuma. Saul cuhlwe, tsupop gade tetdi, nah pe lampui ga miedi.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Cipaucai, David cuhlwe, tsupop gade tetdi, delwe pecai Saul de qugai: “Hegwangpei a mpaubo.” Saul pecai nreu twagwa gai ge, David pecu rüt eh hangdeu ga pe zu keumie. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />David Saul dage rangdi, “Daitei nang mina ‘Ainie, David ncu rezam kera peeila lie, de eh rang kecume sam pung lano?” <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Henai nang n miakle ngau da dainzwa eh RAMPAUBE ncu a ba gage kaibeu bi anui tsupop ga kebam dau. Mi kangge ncu teitset lodi, ciude Ih ncu kelibeu. Ih rang, ‘Ih a mpaube dage a ba hwa gai lak; kedanemene pecu au RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelu Hegwangpei lu.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Ainie, A pei, pielo a ba ga dai keu bam bi. N cwatie tu gade dang mpet kelu pai Ih danglu ciude ncu teitsetti ma, Ih ncu rezam mede tei keherei kera peila kemak ndu keliage, nah Ih ndage kemau tei gai dima, nang acu teitset kera peila liede. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />A nai caube mau bi peu RAMPAUBE de tiak lulo, nah RAMPAUBE de peu acu saja peu de lubui nang ada ge tei gai kebam dungde ziemne, dede Ih madau gede ncu rezam dilak. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Ndaa hangkiasam rang kela de nzwa, ‘Kemaume dade kemau bata petla.’ Dede Ih au ncu rejam dilak lie. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Israelme gwangpei caude renia lano? Nang cau cai zuimie lano? Heteu tsai kedi ge cai! Tammaine ge cai! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />RAMPAUBE de peu tiak zie, nah anai caube mau bi pane cet zie, nah pecu peu makie cide pie kelube teilu, nah acu gumlu, nah acu n dade kelikelube tei lulo.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />David Saul de sam aidungde marang cangdi ge, Saul rangdi, “Aide n kwa deni, a na David?” Saul hap cuhdi. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Pa David dage rangdi “Nang au a swa de masang kiee lie. Kedanemene nang keyile a ziehi teibeu, Ih n dage kemau tei gai liede.” <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Nang henai daikenzwa ge nang a dade yibi kecu keulia da, kedanemene nang acu teitsetti ma, RAMPAUBE acu n ngaugia be ba kangga ge acu kai kebeu dau. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Magade mi ge pe ngauraume gede ngaulu cai, pa pecu peu rejam mezing eh tet lu zieni? RAMPAUBE de peu ncu makeyi teu samlam beulu, nang a dage henai ngaugia keulia kegai de ziemne. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Cu au, nang Israel reu hegwangpei tei kera nah n kedi kang gade Israelme hegwangram aide bam jüja kera Ih ci mci luda. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />RAMPAUBE zi gade nang a leuhme dang gidi mede acai mbaibeu zielie kecu nah a pei ki gade a zi ngkap dilak lie kecu sampet beulo. <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Cine David pa ciciu luzie lie kecu Saul dage pe sam pet gaibeu. Pecai Saul kilung ga gwangdi, dede David nah pe minadung penui mbaibam ga caili miedi.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">David, Nabal nah Abigail</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samuel tsaidi ge, Israelme pelane gwang ngkwa lwe pe ziemne hap, delwe penui pecu Ramah ga pe ki nam gage kungdi. Pecai David cuhlwe Paran hetaideu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moan kideu ketsai</char></note> ga miedi.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Maon nam ga mipei ge Carmel nam ga pe mabam de bam. Mipei aipaude hei süt cuge. Pa pe meuründung cangcum nah pe meu cangge bam. Pa Carmel gade pe meurün mai bitbam. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Cipau peide pezi cai Nabal, nah penau zi cai Abigail. Penau Abigail hezuyi nah mcing süt. Dede Nabal au perata sia nah maidakme ge. Pa au Caleb leuhme ge. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />David hetaideu gade Nabal pe meurün mai bit kebam ha siulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Cine David rehangme hang kerei de langgai. David rehangme da rangdi, “Carmel ga hangcuh, delwe Nabal da mie, delwe a zi teu pecu kelum gailo. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Nnui pe dage rangbeulo, ‘Lungyi eh lung lulo. Kezuyi nda, nah kezuyi n kelak da nah nda kebam pelane da peu bam lulo. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Nang meurün mai kebitme bam lie Ih siu. N meurün kekwamedung anuide ngngwa bam la, nah anui penuide rezam dima, nah penui gu magede gahdi ma, penui peting pelane Carmel gabam. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />N rehangme de keteulu, nah penui ncu rangbeu zie. Cu n miakngau gade a minadung depeu pesui lu. Kedanemene anui hengyi tingba benai gwang luda. Kehereide nang teilu kebui n na ga kebam nsam gade n kilame de nah n zangbe David de peu gailo.’”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />David pe minadung gwanglu ge, Nabal dage David zi gade penui ma pelane rangbeu delwe cika kwabam. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />David kilamedung dage Nabal samkeli gai, “Cau David no? Nah caube Jesse napei no? Cudau kilame pe n paumedung dade pak tet kedi kiee süt dida. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Ih a tangku nah a dui nah a hetei meurün mai kebitme ziemne Ih makaune daptset pwa kebam de Ih cikemak gade gwang kelame de Ih penuide pwa beu dizie ni?” <verse eid="1SA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Cine David minadung nreugwang eh cailigwang, delwe rang kegai pelane sam de pe dage paubeu. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />David pe minadung dage rangdi, “Nnui pelane pe kingtie keu punglu.” Cine penui pelane pe kingtie keupunglu. David de pe kingtie keupunglu. Pe mina hai mdai ge David caisui tetdi, nah mina haina ge mania taiga kwa bamdi.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Dede rehangme ge Nabal nau Abigail dage rang eh; pa rangdi “David anui mpaube de kelum kegai sam tei hetaideu gade samgwame kangge de langgai, ciude pa penuide henui teidi. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Ciulie de minadung anui dade yi süt, penui madaude anuide rezam ma, nah anui penuide ngngwa luhdung ga mie kelatane magede gah dima. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Penui tangdeu ge nzwa tingmui tingba de anuide gumbeu, anui peting pelane anui meurün haudungde kwa eh penuide ngngwa kebam dau. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Ciziemne Aide cet gaidai eh nang daipai tei maisiabi cet lulo, kedanemene anui mpaube nah pe kelak peciakne ziemne kesia ge riem pwa bam di delu. Pa au pelung takzu kedine, mige de pecu ngngwa macet riem ncüt lama.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Pecai Abigail zette cu tangku kwak haina keulu, zau la kena, hemeu mtei kelube mengei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">20 kilogram</char></note>, tangku ru kelube kilogram mengei, kubetsi peu haige, nah tangzüttsi telei kelu tangku kwa hai na, keu lwe cidungde gadadung reu gage kailu. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Pa pe kilame dage rangdi, “Nnui a dwarai miecu nah Ih nnui caisui luzie.” Dede pa pe nahpei Nabal dage pa tei kebam ha magede rang ma. <verse eid="1SA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Pa pe gada reu ga tet gwang eh lamlwatu lebie hung luge, David nah pe minadung pe taiga gwang nah pa penuide redaulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Cu David pekatei pecu rang eh, “Kesang Ih kemta gade mina aipau de ma pelane gumbeu la da hetaideu gade, ciu eh pegu magede teinggah dima, nah pa kesiabe le pwa acu keyi ziehi teibeu. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Peu Tinggwang de a dage tei gailo, David nah ciswa de kiee gwa kecu, magade Ih tingcang gage pekilung gade mipei hangge dede bang beu di cai.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigail David de ngaulu sang ge, pa zette pe gada reu gade nghunglu delwe pezu hangdeu le nkumpung eh David dwa ga keukei miedi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Pa David piga keumie eh rangdi, “A kedibo, peu ada rünne kemau gwang lulo. Kehereide n kilabe de peu nda ge sam ranglo, nah n kilabe kwa kingnei gailo. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nabel au kesia nah perata kesia mi hangge kecu, kehereide de peu a mpaube de pe sam kette kingnei so. Pa au kemie kauge, pezi nzwa eh. Dede Ih n kilame a mpaube rehangme de ngau ma, nang lang kegai peide. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Ciciucai cu, a mpaube, RAMPAUBE nah nang ring kela nzwa, RAMPAUBE ne n ba le teitset nah hekum peidi lu kera gade kezeu beu da, cide nzwa eh n ngauraume pelane de, nah a mpaube de rejam kera tei kelame de peu Nabal nzwa reset pung kelube teilo. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Cu n kilabe a mpaube ziemne teugwang kela mta mapeu peu aide luu lulo, n minadung a mpaube caisui kelame de peulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Kehereide n kilabe kemau tei kedi leune maugi beulo, RAMPAUBE ne a mpaube ki kesang tei beuzie kecune, kedanemene a mpaube RAMPAUBE pe reutak regi kelane, nah nang ring kelatane n dade ma kesia gede ngaulak. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Keheibede ncu gwaketang nah teitset kera teicuh liede, RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang ne a mpaube teilung de pema pemi kehung ge gum kebam nzwa ncu gum beuzie; nah pa n ngauraume teilung au, mige pe tangnung le ncu kekap nzwa pane penuide kelien gi dizie. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />RAMPAUBE a mpaube ziemne pa nda ge sampet kebeu nzwa maleune teibeu zie, nah ncu peu Israel reu muiteu tei kera kedet luda. <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />Aide n ziemne swaga püt ge dilak, nang kemau kegah zai de rui mpet kedi de, mede a mpaube pekatei pecu kelilu kera ketei kedine. Cidau RAMPAUBE a mpaube ziemne keyi tei beuzie, n kilabe de nsung gailo.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />David Abigail dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE de twalu, Israelme Tinggwang de, henai peu acu redau kerane ncu lang kegaibe. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />N maci de ziemne Tinggwang de twa nah nang samlampunglu, kedanemene nang henai acu kai nzeu kelune, Ih mide daptset eh kemau teidi kera gade nah a ba le akatei a kum peidi kera gade kezeu kebeune! <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kesang kecune, ring kela, RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang Ih ncu teikeherei di kera gade, pa acu kam beuda, nang kelwa mie acu redau lu maige, cika kesangde ncünne tingcang gage Nabal mipei hangge ngiena tsai kapdi kerage.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Cine David pa teugwang keladung de pecu pe ba gade luulu delwe pa pe dage rangdi, “N kilung ga kezuyi teu cailigwang cu; ainie, Ih n sam de kingnei lu nah ncu luulu da.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigail Nabal kilung ga hengyi eh telei bam, hegwangpei nzwa eh hengyi be da caili gwangdi; ainie, Pa sakmie süt bam kedine, Nabal peda pesuiyi eh bam. Cine pa tingcang kemaktane pecu magede ranglia ma. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Tingcang Nabal mcing kebam dau, pe nau pedage maleune paubeu; Pecu keheu süt di, eh pe mlung tsaidi, nah pa pezeu ga tangtsu ge nzwa zeu bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Cide ziangrei kenzwa ge gwangdi ge RAMPAUBE Nabal de kedeu gai ge pa tsaidi.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />David Nabal tsai kedi ha siulu ge, pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBE de twalu! Pa Nabal ba gade acu rang msia kecune a kum pei beuda, delwe peu pe kilabe de peu kemau gade teidi meda. Pa Nabal kemau tei kedine pemau ziemne pecu saja peuda.” Pecai David Abigail de pe ziemne pecu penau kera nah pe sampet de langgai. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />David kilame Carmel ga Abigail da gwang kelu dau, penui pecu resiu nah rangdi, “David ncu penau lu kerane ncu pe da ngngwa gwang kera anuide langgai lie.” <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Pa cuhlu, pekatei pezu hangdeu ga keumie lwe rangdi, “Ainie, n kilapui au a mpaube kilame pi hui kera be kila lie.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigail zette cuhlwe pe gada reuga nghanglu, pe kilapui hang mengei ngngwa kelame pe caisuidi; nah pa David samgwame caisui eh penau di.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />David Jezreel nam gade Ahinoam de penau dailu; penai hangna na pe nau teilu. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Cidau, Saul pe napui Michal, David nau de pwa, Gallim nam gade kegwangbe, Laish napei Paltiel de peudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">David Saul de mbaidai kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Midung ge Ziph gade Gibeah ga Saul da gwang eh rangdi, “David Jeshimon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeshimon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cf. 23:9</char></note> dwaga kebam Hakilah deutu ga mbai bam meni?” <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Pecai Saul cuhlwe Ziph hetaideu ga miedi, delwe Israelmena cangcum de kedetlwe pecu nzang eh, David de peei kerane Ziph hetaideu ga miedi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Saul Hakilah deutu lampuikang gage ramzeuki teilu, cide Jeshimon deutu dwaga. Dede David hetaideu ga lareu, nah pa Saul hetaideu ga pecai sui gwangkela ngaulu. <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />Cine David reketme de langgai nah Saul cika bamlie kecu cilu. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />David cuhlu eh Saul ramzeuki kebam ni ga miedi. Pa Saul nah reugwame reu kedibe Ner napei Abner zip kebam ni ngaulu, Saul ramzeuki lungga zipbam, nah pe minadung pecu twagwalwe zip ciobam.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Pecai David Hittime pei Ahimelech nah Abishai, Zeruiah (David tipui) napei, Joab sinabe dage rangdi, “Nnai caube acu ngngwa Saul ramzeuki ga nghung lai?” Abishai rangdi, “Ih! Ih ncu ngngwa nghung zie” <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Cine cipau ziu David penai Abishai Saul ramzeuki ga lütlwe Saul ramzeuki sumga pe hengei hangdeu gage pe peu taiga ge cum pwabam eh cika zip bam. Abner nah pe reugwamedung pecu twagwalwe zipbam. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Pecai Abishai David dade rangdi, “Henai Tinggwang n ngauraube de n ba gage kaibeu da. Peu acu kehereide pe hengei keulu eh pecu hiagai lo, piage gage pecu hangdeu gage hiagim dizie. Ih pecu pia na au teilak.” <verse eid="1SA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />David Abishai dage rangdi, “Nang pecu tei diso. Kedanemene cau ge RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelube de tei rejamdi delwe kemau tei melie lubui no?” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />David rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ring kelanzwa, RAMPAUBE ne pecu teitset zie, mede tsaidi kera peting gwangcang zie, mede pa hereu ga mie eh ngkap dizie. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />RAMPAUBE depeu pane keniak kelube de Ih a ba le rejam kera kezeu beu; dede cu, Ih n dade kiela, pe peu taiga kebam pe hengei nah pe duila pwalwe tetdi go.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Cine David hengei penai duila de Saul peu taigade pwalu eh penui tetdi. Migede penuide ngau ma mede David daipai tei dibi kecu cima, mede migede mrak cuh dima. Penui pelane zip zing kedine, kedanemene RAMPAUBE dade zipzing kecude penui reuga nghung kedine.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Pecai David hangdeu kedale kahpet nah lamlwatu mdeitube ga saplu; penai kakga mdei süt bam. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />David Ner napei Abner nah reugwamedung dage pe rata di; nah pa rangdi, “Nang a sam keli lakni, Abner?” Pecai Abner pe sam keli eh rangdi, “Nang cauno Hegwangpei dage sah kebam ai?” <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />David Abner dage keligai, “Nang kuusüt kecu pei ge meni?” Israel gade nang kenzwa cau bamno? Ciu eh nang daitei n mpaube hegwangpei mapie eh gumlu me no? Cune mige n mpaube hegwangpei de teitsetdi kera lütda. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Nang aide teikedi yi ma. RAMPAUBE ring kelanzwa, nnui tsaidi kera lui lie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelu nnui mpaube de gumlu me kecu. Cu ainie hegwangpei hengei nah duila pe peu taiga kebamde daiga bamno?<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Saul David kwa cilu nah rangdi, “Cide n kwa ni, a na David?” David rangdi, “Cide a kwa da, oh hegwangpei, a mpaubo.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />David rangdi, “A mpaube daitei pe kilabe de gwazui lareu no? Ih daipai tei dino? A ba ga dai kesia ge bamno? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Cu cine, Ih n dade a nggia kiela, peu a mpaube hegwangpei de pe kilabe samdung kiengnei gailo. RAMPAUBE ne acu renialu kera ncu teuncuh beucai, pecu peu reca ge luu lulo; dede mina ne cide teigai liecai, RAMPAUBE dwa gade peu penuide reset pung kelube teilu lo, penui henai acu gwampet kedine, ciu de Ih RAMPAUBE mapwame ge melu kerane; penui ada rangdi, ‘Mie keda rabedung de reca lulo.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Cu cine, peu hangdeube ga a jai nghai eh RAMPAUBE dwa gade mdei diso; rehume lamlwadung ga nruine ge cai zui kecudau Israel gwangpei tammaine ge de peei kecu.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Pecai Saul rangdi, “Ih kemau tei dida. Cailigwanglu, David, a na; Ih madaude ncu tei rejam dailak ta. Kedanemene henai n miakngau gade a teilung pemi hungsüt kecune.” Ainie, Ih kemieme nggwa de tei dida nah ma tei mausüt dida, <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />David samkeli gai, “Ainie, aika n hengei bam, hegwangpei! Peu n rehangme hangge de aika gwang eh keulu delwe nda pwagwang lulo. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />RAMPAUBE samsang nah masang kelame keheibe de ziehi peu lulo. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ncu henai a ba gage kai beuda, dede Ih RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelube de tei rejam daulak. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Ainie, a miakngau gade n teilung hungsüt kecunzwa, cine peu RAMPAUBE miakngau gade a teilung depeu pemi hungki lo, nah pa peu acu lungrei pelane gade kelibeu kelube teilu lo.” <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Pecai Saul David dage rangdi, “Ncu peu samlam pung kelube teilo, David a na! Nang ma kedidung tei bizie nah nang cidung reu ngkieng luzie.” Cine David pe lampuile tetdi, nah Saul pe ki ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">David Philistinme kakga kebam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />David pe lung gade rangdi, “Ih cu tingnai ge Saul ba gade acu teitset dizie da. A ziemne Philistinme deu gage pakgai kelu swade magade yiki kecu gahda; Ciude Saul a ziemne Israel deurai pelane ga acu peei sita dizie; ainzwa eh Ih pe ba gade pakmpet luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />David cuhlu delwe pa nah pecu ngngwa kelame mina hai herok de ngngwalwe Gath ga hegwangpei, Maok napei Achish da miedi. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />David nah pe minadung, mina hangge ge de penui kelakdung si eh ngngwa Achish Gath ga lungh bamdi nah David penau hangna pecu ngngwa la. Ahinoam Jezreelme pui ge, nah Nabal nau Abigail au Carmelme pui ge. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Saul de David au Gath gage pakgai kedi ranglia beu, cine pa pecu peeisi tadi.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />David Achish dage rangdi, “Ih n miakngau ga petau liecai, peu deudi ga namdidung kakgade namdi ge ga heni ge penuide peu acu peulo, ciude Ih cika lungh luzie. N kilabe daitei ncu ngngwa hegwangbam namdi ga lungh lai?” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Cine cipau tingdau Achish pecu Ziklag nam de peudi, nah aide ziemne Ziklag aipaucai gwale de Judah ga hegwangpeidung gu teilamui di. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />David Philistinme deu ga kelung ting mmi ge nah kei mdai lungh di.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />David nah pe minadung heni ketsamtsam Geshurme, Girzme nah Amalekme; heleuh lunghkebam deu ga kelamedung, ndaa ting gede penui cika lunghla kedidungde gwaketang, nnui Shur ga mie kecunzwa, Egypt deu ga kecang gwalu. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />David hangdeu cide gwaketang nah mipui mede mipei pelane de teitset eh; pa meurün, ketum, gadadung, utdung nah paiheni kecang de luu lu; nah pa Achish da caili eh gwangdai lala. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Achish rangla, “Nang henaipia caude mie gwano? David ainzwa samkeli zie, Judah reu tingbangle, mede Jerahmeelme reu tingbangle, mede Kenitme reu tingbangle.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />David mipei mede mipui de de teitset dila, nah penuide Gath ga ngngwa gwang kai ma, rang eh, “Ciu eh penui pa nah pe minadung ha ranglia kelu teilu lama, ‘David tei kelubedung teilu.’” David Philistinme deudi ga kelungtane ainzwa eh pelane teigwang. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Achish David da kenlum bam eh ranggai, “Pa pe minadung Israelme ne pecu ngkau süt kecu teidi; pa ciziemne a kilabe kelungta teila zieda.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s">Saul nah Endor ga rekapui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Pecai peting tie mene, Philistinme Israelme de ngngwa keregi kera gwang penui reugwamedung ngkwalu hereu tei kera. Achish David dage rangdi, “Kedanemene nang nah n minadung acu ngngwamie a lambie de keregi kera ci mci lulo” <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />David Achish dage rangdi, “Cine nang n kilame daipai teilu buibi nang ci luzie.” Achish David dage rangdi, “Cine Ih ncu a pumkwame n tingbazie pelane tei kera tei luzie.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Cidau Samuel tsaidi da, nah Israelme pelane pe ziemne hap nah pecu pe namdi Ramah gage kungdi. Saul ketsaime mede rabedung de mpaukelame leune de hangdeu cikade kaamdi. <verse eid="1SA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Philistinme penui katei gwang ngkwalwe Shunem nam gage ramzeuki teilu; nah Saul Israelme pelane de qu hekwalu, nah penui Gilboa deutu gage ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Saul Philistinme reugwame de ngaulu ge ngngi di, nah pe lung mbeu sütdi. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Saul RAMPAUBE dade kengha ziemne kekie tei, dede RAMPAUBE pe mang gade de, mede Urim, nah mede caihakecime da dede pe kekie teibeu tadi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Cine Saul pe kangme dage rangdi, “Acu reka mepui gede peei beulo, ciude Ih mie pe dade ma keteu zie.” Pe kedime pe dage keligai, “Ainie, Endor ga mipui ge pa ketsaime de mpau lalie rangla.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Saul pekatei pe rehi teitsamlu, pai ketsambedung bahlu, delwe tingmui ge pa nah pe mina hangna de ngngwalwe mipui de da miedi. Pa rangdi, a ziemne rabe de mpau gailo, n dade kiela Ih, rang kebeube zi ada keugwang beulo. <verse eid="1SA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mipui be peda rangdi, “Peilo, nang hegwangpei Saul tei kegaide cika bamzie. Pa dainzwa ketsaime rabedung de kempau mede pa cipau deu gade kaamdibi kecu. Cine nang daitei eh a teilung keu hetak tei lano, acu teitsetdi kera cet lani?” <verse eid="1SA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Saul pe dage sampetgai nah rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ring kelanzwa, nang ma aide tei kegai ne saja peu lak.” <verse eid="1SA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Pecai mipuibe rangdi, “Ih caude n ziemne qugai lai”? Saul rangdi, “Samuel de qugai a ziemne.” <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mipuibe Samuel de ngau luge, pa sahbak eh mra pwa Saul dage rangdi, “Nang daitei eh a dage heciem tei lano? Kedanemene nang au Saul.” <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Ngngi diso, nang daipai ngau bamno?” Mipuibe Saul da rangdi, “Ih rabe ge kideu gade cuhkela ngau bamlie.” <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Pa pecu rang eh, “Pa rehi dainkenzwa geno?” Pa rang eh, “Kecing pei ge cuhla, pa pai kedige bahla.” Saul cide Samuel lie kecu cilu, nah pa pecu herüt peu eh pe zu hangdeu ga keumie di.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samuel Saul dage rang eh “Nang daitei acu kebwak lano nah acu peu daitie eh cailigwang lano?” Saul keligai, “Ih au keherei süt kecuga la dida, kedanemene Philistinme acu ngngwa hereu teila dida, nah Tinggwang acu püt dida nah a kekie teibeu meda, caihakecime de, mede hemang lam de. Ciziemne Ih ncu qugai delie, ncu peu Ih daipai tei maisiabi acu ranglia gai kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samuel rang eh, “Nang daitei eh RAMPAUBE ncu gikedidau nah n ngauraube tei kedidau acu qu lano? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />RAMPAUBE n dage tei zielie pa rangkebeu gade nzwa eh pa tei gaida. RAMPAUBE n ba gade hegwangram de keugi dida nah pa cide mi kedage de peu dida, David de. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE kwa de mzailu meda nah pe lungka Amelekme dage teigai kemakne, ciziemne pa henai aide n dage teigai dida. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />RAMPAUBE ncu nah Israelme de ngngwa Philistinme ba gage kaibeu dizie, nah ncünne nang nah n napeidung acu si eh bamdi zieda. RAMPAUBE Israel reugwame de Philistinme ba gage kaibeu zie.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Saul zette kau miedi delwe hangdeu ga zeumie bamdi kedanemene Samuel kerang samdungde ne pecu keheudi kecune. Kedanemene pa tingmuizie pelane, nah tingbazie pelane matyei ta kedine, peda kengkieng gah di. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Mipui ge Saul da gwang ge pecu keheu pwa kebam ngaulu, pa pe dage rangdi, “Pielo, n kilabepui n kwa ngking luda; Ih a teilung kengngi gage kaibeu dida nah nang n samdung acu rangkelia de ngking luda. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Cu ciziemne, Ih n dade kiela, n kilabe pui kwa kingnei gailo, nah acu peu taktyei ndwa ga kecam nage telei gailo. Kedanemene nang ma tyeilu eh n kengkieng ngau dailwe nang n lampui ga tetmielu kerane.” <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Dede Saul laklie di nah rang eh “Ih ma tyei lak.” Dede pe kilamedung, mipuibe de nzang, pecu ma tyeilo ketangbi di, nah pa penui kwa mneilu. Cine pa hangdeu gade cuhlu delwe zeu ga ntum bamlu. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mipuibe de heki ga ketumna gui hemitu kebamde; zette pa daptset lu. Pecai pa tokkui, kesa keulu, teleilu, delwe cehi si mene tangku rulu. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Pa Saul nah pe kilame de pwagwang beu, nah penui cide tyeilu. Cidau penui cuhlu delwe cipau ziu tetdi.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Philistinme David de mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Cu Philistinme penui reugwame pelane de Aphek namdi gage qu hekwalu, nah Israelme Jezreel ga duilet ge gage ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Philistinme gwangpei minadung pe hai nah pe cang de ngngwa tetpet, David nah pe minadung pe cailebie Achish de kekwame de ngngwa eh tetpet. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Pecai keda Philistinme hegwangnadung rangdi, “Hebrewme aidungde aika daipai tei lano?” Achish, Philistinme hegwangna kedage dage rangdi, “Aide David meni? Saul kilabe, Israel gu hegwangpei, pa pe ting ketiege acu ngngwala dida, nah pa a da gwangkelu gade henai kecang Ih pe dade kemau gede ngau luma?” <verse eid="1SA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Dede Philistinme hegwangna Achish de penui rata eh rangdi, “Cipaude de langcaili dilu, nangne kepeu heni gage pecu langcaili dilu, pa anuide ngngwa hereuga mielak, kedanemene hereu keteidau pa anuide renia cuhdi lubui. Kedanemene pa pe mpaube suiyi ngaudailu kera lampui aiswade pe ziemne lampui keyi daipai bamno? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Penui hangge ge dage rangdi, helim lim eh David dage lei tei bamla kebambe aide de meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">‘Saul mina cangcang de gilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">nah David mina cang kereirei de gilu?’” de rang eh.<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Achish David de qulwe pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ring kelanzwa, nang masangla, nah nang hereu ga acu ngngwamie kera nah nang ngngwa gwang kera aide a suiyi da; Kedanemene nang a da gwangkelu benai gade henai kecang Ih n dade kemauge de ngau luma. Dede hegwangna kedame ncu pe suilu meda. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Cine n lungciep gade mie cu nah cailigwanglu, ciude nang Philistinme hegwangna suisiet tei dilak.” <verse eid="1SA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />David Achish dade rangdi, “Dede Ih daipai tei dino? Ih n kilabe n da gwang kelubenai gade henai kecang kemauge de ngaulu meliecai, Ih daitei ncu a mpaube nah a hegwangpei de ngngwa mie eh ngauraume de regi melaino?” <verse eid="1SA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Achish David sam keligai nah rangdi, Ih a lambie de au ncu Tinggwang samgwame ge nzwa eh n mauge de kegah Ih cibam; Philistinme hegwangna rangdi, Pa anuide hereu ga ngngwamie lak dedi. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Cine n mpaube kilame ncu nzang kegwangme de ngngwalwe tingcang cuh zilu; nah nang cuh zilulwe tingcang ting baapet de, tet dilu. <verse eid="1SA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Cine David nah pe minadung, pecai benai tingcang nuge culwe Philistia ga cailigwang kera tetcuh di, dede Philistinme Jezreel gage hereu ziemne tetgai di.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">David Amalekitme de ngkap kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Lang cumne cai David nah pe minadung Ziklag namdi ga gwang dailu, Amalekme Negev ngkanglebie gwa eh Ziklag gwaketang eh, renam ru ngkapdi, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />nah cika kebam mipuidung nah keceu kedi mina pelane de tuilu. Penui migede de teitset dima, dede penui tet kecudau penuide ngngwalwe tetdi. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Lang cumne benai David nah pe minadung namdi ga gwang luge, cide renam de ru kedi ngaulu, nah penui naudung, penui napeidung, nah penui napuidung de ngngwa tetkedi ngaulu. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />David nah pe minadung pecu ngngwakelame penui kwa sah eh hapdi nah penui kengkieng gahdi kemaktane hap bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />David nau kena Ahinoam Jezreel mepui nah Abigail Nabal nau Carmel mepui de kecang de ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />David pe lung keherei sütdi, kedanemene minadung pecu tangtsu pwasam kera rang kebamne. Kedanemene mina pelane, keheibede pe napeime nah pe napuime ziemne penui lung siasüt kedine. Dede David RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang ne pe katei pecu teingkuu beu.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />David Ahimelech napei cingkupei Abiathar dage rangdi, “Ih n dage kiela, acu hekeutu pai de keugwang beulo aziemne aika.” Abiathar David da hekeutupai de keugwangbeu. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />David RAMPAUBE dade puisau cilu kerane, kiegai, “Magade Ih penuide zuimie liecai, Ih penuide ngamlu buini?” RAMPAUBE pecu keligai, “Penuide zuimie cu, kedanemene nang penuide ngambi lubui nah nang ma pelane ngaudai bi luzie.” <verse eid="1SA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Cine David mie, pa nah minadung hai herok pecu ngngwalwe tetpet; penui Besor reuki ga gwanglu, ge midungge cika bamdi. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Dede David zuimie la, pa nah mina hai mdai de ngngwa eh; mina haina be Besor reuki de kahpet kera penui mneizu kedine cika bamdi.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Penui Egyptme ge luh gala eh ngaulwe David da ngngwa gwang, penui pecu tangku peu eh pa tyeilu nah penui pecu dui sak kera peu; <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />nah penui pecu tangjüttsi le tangku ru kelube kena peu. Pa cide tyei luge, pe kengkieng gwang dailu, kedanemene pa lang cumne tingmui tingba matyei masak mene bam kedine. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />David pe dage rangdi, “N mpaube cauno? nah nang daiga de gwang lano?” Pa rangdi, Ih au Egypt rehangme ge, Amalekme ge kila lie. Kedanemene Ih mateeidi kecune a mpaube acu gikedi lang cumne dida. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Anui Judah deu, Kerethme gu Negev nah Caleb gu Negev deu gwa dida nah anui Ziklag deu ru dida. <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />David pe dage rangdi, “Nang acu renam gwa kecume da ngngwamie beuzie mi?” Egyptme pei de rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang zi gade acu teitset laklie kecu mede acu a mpaube ba gade kaibeu dilak lie kecu n sam pet lucai Ih ncu ngngwa nghung beuzie.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Nah Egyptme pei David de ngngwamie keludau, renam gwa kelume heni pelane ga gumpung eh matyei, sak nah helim lim bam, kedanemene penui Philistinme penai Judah deu gade hemaa pelane tuikiee süt kelune. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Pecai benai tingcang gade David penuide gwaketang eh tinghegi kecang penuide ngngwa keregi. Rehangme hai mdai utdung reuga kelame paktet kedigwale, penui migede pak mbai luma. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />David Amalekme teutet kedi leune keukeli dailu; nah David pe nau kenade si eh kelilu. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Ma gede gah dima, hename de mede kecingme liede, napeidung mede napuidung liede, mede hemaa tuiteu kedi liede, mede gwa kelamedung penui ziemne keuteu kedidung keheibe de. David cidung pelane keugwang dailu. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />David meurün haudung nah hetum haudung pelane de ngaudailu. Pe minadung penui dwa gage penui kaunedung de gwa eh rangdi, “Aide David gu.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />David mina haina ge mnei zudi eh pe caisui pa kedime da gwanglu, Besor reuki ga peu bam kedi medung de. Mina aipaudung de David de redau kera tetpet nswadi nah mina pecu de ngngwa kebamme. David mina aidungde da gwang ge, pa penuide kelumgai. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Cidau kesiame nah lui kemakme David de ngngwa kemieme kakgade rangdi, “Mina aidungde anuide ngngwamie ma, anui penuide matui kelube kette peulak anui ngaudai kelube. Mina keheibe de pe nau nah pe name de gwalie keu gailak ngngwalwe peu penuide tetdi.” <verse eid="1SA 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Cidau David rangdi, “Nnui ainzwadi kerabe ma, a sinamedung, RAMPAUBE anuide kepeude teu eh. Pa anuide peu kwaklu nah anui ba gage kai beuda anuide renia kelame reu ngkiengkelu peuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Caune nnui kwa kingnei zieno aipau hade ga? Pelane hereu ga kemieme lie nsam maisia cinzwa taktyei nia kwa eh bam kedime lie de nsam zie.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />David aide le hezai ge teidi, nah cide cipaunai gwale gade henai kecang de Israel ga hezai cide mzai ladi.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />David Ziklag ga gwang luge, pa hemaa tui kelube kesa Judah ga hangkiame de langgai, pe zangme de, rang eh, “Ainie, aika RAMPAUBE ngauraume dade tuikelu gade nnui ziemne mta mapeu ge la.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Pa Bethel ga kebam hangkiame dage de ma kesa langgai, nah Ramoth tingbangle kebam minadung dage de, nah Jattir ga kebamme dage de, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />nah Aroer ga kebamme dage de, nah Siphmoth, Eshtemoa kebamme dage de. <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />Pa Rakal ga kebamme dage nah hangkiame dage kesa langgai beu, nah Jerahmeelme namdi ga kebamme dage de, nah Kenitme namdi ga kebamme dage de, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />nah Hormah, Bor-Ashan, Athak ga kebamme dage de, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />nah Hebron ga kebamme dage de, nah heni pelane David nah pe minadung mie bam kela ga.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Saul pekatei pecu teitset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Cinzwa kebamdau Philistinme reugwame Israelme de ngngwa hereu tei. Israel minadung pakdi Philistinme dwade nah Gilboa deutu gade mina kekie de teitsetdi. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Dede Philistinme Saul nah pe napeidung zuimie. Philistinme pe napeidung de tuilu Jonathan, Abinadab, nah Malki-Shua de teitsetdi. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Saul de ngngwa regi sütdi, nah pecu ngauraume lakpitsidung ne kapdi nah penui ziemne pa rejam nsiasütdi. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Ge Saul pe reunet pwakelabe dage rangdi, “N kiengtie zütlwe acu reutset dilu. Mecai hegeurum kemakme ne gwang acu zaira teidi zielu.” Dede pe reunet pwa kelabe cide tei raudi kedanemene pa ngngi süt kedine. Cine Saul pekatei pe kiengtie zütlwe cipau reu gage kaugai. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Pe reunet pwakelabe Saul tsaikedi ngau luge, pade cinzwa eh pekatei pe kingtie reu gage kaugai eh Saul de ngngwa tsaidi. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Cinzwa eh Saul pe napeidung hangcum nah pe reunet pwakelabe tsaidi, mina aidungde pelane langnai gage tsai ncütdi.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Israelme Jezreel langkam kedalebie nah Jordan reu kahpet le lungh kebamme Israel minadung pakkedi ngau luge, nah Saul nah pe namedung de tsaikedi ha siu luge, penui namdidung gidi eh pakdi, nah Philistinme gwang eh cika lungh di. <verse eid="1SA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Hereu teikecu pecia benai Philistinme ketsai paaudung de lamlui kera gwang, ge penui Saul nah pe napei hangcum paaudung Gilboa deutu gade ngaulu. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Penui Saul peu danglu, pe reunet keulu, delwe Philistinme deu pelane gage samliakeyi penui gu reca mamie kibung dung ga nah penui minadung dage paubeu kera samgwame de langgai. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Penui pe reunet niadung Ashtoreth rabe de mamie kerecaki gage kailu, nah penui pe paau Beth Shan namdi kirie gage giagim eh retlu. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Gilead Jabesh namdi ga kelung minadung Philistinme Saul dage teikegai ha siu luge, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />mina regi kerame pelane cuhlwe nah tingmui pelane Beth Shan gage tetgai, Saul nah pe napeime paaudung namdi kirie gade pwa nghunglu. Penui Jabesh ga pwa cailigwanglu delwe penuide cikage rudi. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Pecai penui radung pwalwe Jabesh ga tamarisk bang kang gage penuide kungdi, delwe lang hena ne hap ge mmwang bamdi.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>